<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">1 Khang tangthu</book>
  <para style="h">1 Khang tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Khang tangthu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Khang tangthu</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Khang tangthu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adam ii tapa Seth, Seth ii tapa Enosh, Enosh ii tapa Kenan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kenan ii tapa Mahalalel, Mahalalel ii tapa Jared,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jared ii tapa Enoch, Enoch ii tapa Methuselah, Mathuselah ii tapa Lamech,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lamech ii tapa Noah ahi uh hi. Noah in tapa thum nei a Shem, Ham le Japheth te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Japheth ii tapate — Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech le Tiras hi a — amate min a tap mite ii taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer ii suan le paalte sia Ashkenaz, Riphath le Togarmah mite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Javan ii suan le paalte sia Elishah, Spain, Cyprus le Rhodes mite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ham ii tapate — Cush, Egypt, Libya le Canaan hi a — amate min a tap mite ii taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cush ii suan le paalte sia Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah le Sabteca mite ahi uh hi. Raamah ii suan le paalte sia Sheba le Dedan mite ahi uh hi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cush in Nimrod a kici tapa khat nei in, Nimrod sia leitung ah a minthang ngual zo masabel ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt ii suan le paalte sia Lydia, Anam, Lehab, Naphtuh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathrus, Casluh le Crete mite ahi uh hi, (Philistine mite sia tuasia ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Canaan ii tapate — a lianbel Sidon le Heth — sia amate ii min a tap mite ii taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Canaan sia Jebus te, Amor te, Girgash te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiv te, Ark te, Sin te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Arvad te, Zemar te le Hamath te zongh ii taanghpupi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Shem ii tapate — Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad, Lud, Aram, Uz, Hul, Gether le Meshek — hi uh a, amate ii min a tap mite ii taanghpupite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arpachshad sia Shelah ii pa hi a, Shelah sia Eber ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eber in tapa nii nei a; khat pa ii min sia Peleg hi, banghang ziam cile ama khan sungin mihingte kikhen tham siat hi, a tapa dang khat ii min sia Joktan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joktan ii suan le paalte sia Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ebal, Abimael, Sheba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ophir, Havilah le Jobab mite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shem khang pan Abram khang dong sia a nuai a bang hi: Shem, Arpachshad, Shelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eber, Peleg, Reu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Serug, Nahor, Terah le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abram (Abraham zongh kici) te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham in tapa nii nei in, Isaac le Ishmael ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ishmael ii tapate sia minam sawm le niite ii lutang suak a: Nebaioth (Ishmael ii ta lianbel ii min panin), Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jetur, Naphish le Kedemah te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abraham in a zino Keturah taw in tapa luk nei a: Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak le Shuah te hi. Jokshan in tapa nii nei a: Sheba le Dedan te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midian in tapa nga nei a: Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida le Eldaah te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abraham ii tapa Isaac in tapa nii nei a, Esau le Jacob ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Esau ii tapate sia Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam le Korah te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Eliphaz in a nuai a minamte ii taanghpupi hong suak a: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna le Amalek te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuel sia Nahath, Zerah, Shammah le Mizzah minamte ii taanghpupi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Edom ah a teang ciilte sia a nuai a Seir ii tapate pan khang kizomsuk ahi uh hi. Lotan sia Hori le Homam bee le phungte ii taanghpupi hi. (Lotan in Timna a kici suapuinumei khat nei hi) Shobal sia Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shephi le Onam bee le phungte ii taanghpupi hi. Zibeon in tapa nii nei a, Aiah le Anah ahi uh hi. Anah sia Dishon ii pa hi a, Dishon sia Hamran, Eshban, Ithran le Cheran bee le phungte ii taanghpupi hi. Ezer sia Bilhan, Zaavan le Jaakan bee le phung ii taanghpupi hi. Dishan sia Uz le Aran bee le phungte ii taanghpupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel ngam ah kumpi a om ma in a nuai a kumpite khat zawkciang khat in Edom ngam uk hi: Dinhabah pan Beor ii tapa Bela, Bozrah pan Zerah ii tapa Johab, Teman ngamkhen pan Husham, Avith pan Bedad ii tapa Hadad (Hadad in Moab ngamsung kidona ah Midian te zo hi.) Masrekah pan Samlah, Rehoboth-Ngun-tung pan Shaul, Achbor ii tapa Baal Hanan le Pau pan Hadad in uk uh hi. (Hadad ii zi Mehetabel sia Matred ii tanu, Mezahab ii tunu hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Edom mite sia a nuai a namte bangin kikhen uh a: Timna, Alvah, Jetheth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Magdiel le Iram te hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jacob in tapa sawm le nii nei hi: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Zebulun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan, Joseph, Benjamin, Naphtali, Gad le Asher te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah in tapa a vekpi nga nei hi. Canaan numei a zi Bathshua taw tapa thum nei hi: Er, Onan le Shelah te ahi uh hi. A tapa lianbel Er sia ngilo lei ahikom Topa in that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A monu Tamar taw Judah in tapa nii nei thua a, Perez le Zerah ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Perez in tapa nii nei a Hezron le Hamul ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A suapui pa Zerah in tapa nga nei hi: Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Calcol le Darda ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zerah ii suan le paalte khat ahi Carmi ii tapa Achan in Topa atu a ki aapsa ngal sung pan a kilaak vanhte a kep manin Israel mite tuasiatna thuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethan in tapa khat nei a, Azariah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezron in tapa thum nei hi: Jerahmeel, Ram le Caleb ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram khang panin Jesse khang dong sia a nuai a bang ahi hi: Ram, Amminadab, Nahshon (Judah nam sung pan a minthang khat)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Salmon, Boaz,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Obed le Jesse te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesse in tapa sali nei hi. A lianbel pan a nobel ah: Eliab, Abinadab, Shammah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nethanel, Raddai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ozem le David te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tanu nii zongh nei in, Zeruiah le Abigail te hi. Jesse ii tanu Zeruiah in tapa thum nei hi: Abishai, Joab le Asahel te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tanu dang ahi Abigail in Ishmael ii suan ahi Jether teenpui a, amate in Amasa kici tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hezron ii tapa Caleb in Azubah teenpui a, Jerioth kici tanu khat nei hi. Tua nu in tapa thum nei hi: Jesher, Shobab le Ardon te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azubah a thi zawkciang Caleb in Ephrath teenpui a, Hur kici tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hur ii tapa sia Uri hi in, a tupa sia Bezalel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Heron in kum 60 a phak ciang Machir ii tanu, Gilead ii suapuinu teenpui hi. Amate in Segub kici tapa khat nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Segub in Jair kici tapa khat nei hi. Jair in Gilead ngam ah khuapi 23 uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang Geshur le Aram kumpi ngamte in tua munah khua 60 zothal a, tuasung ah Jair le Kenath khuanote le a kiim a khuate kihel hi. Tua munah a teang mite theampo sia Gilead ii pa Machir ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hezron thi zawkciang a tapa Caleb in a pa ii zi meingongnu Ephrath teenpui hi. Amate in Ashhur kici tapa khat nei a, Ashhur sia Tekoa khua saatpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hezron ii tapa lianbel Jerahmeel in tapa nga nei hi: a lianbel sia Ram hi a, Bunah, Oren, Ozem, le Ahijah te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ram in tapa thum nei hi: Maaz, Jamin le Eker te ahi uh hi. Jerahmeel in Atarah kici zi dang khat nei a, amate in Onam kici tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Onam in tapa nii nei a, Shammai le Jada te ahi uh hi. Shammai zongh in tapa nii nei a, Nadab le Abishur te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abishur in Abihail kici numei khat teenpui in tapa nii, Ahban le Molid nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Abishur ii suapuipa Nadab in tapa nii Seled le Appaim nei a, ahihang Seled sia tapa nei ngawlin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Appaim sia Ishi ii pa hi a, Ishi sia Sheshan ii pa hi in, Sheshan sia Ahlai ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shammai ii suapuipa Jada in tapa nii, Jether le Jonathan nei hi, ahihang Jether sia tapa nei ngawlin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jonathan in tapa nii, Peleth le Zaza nei hi. Hite theampo sia Jerahmeel ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sheshan in tapa nei ngawlin, tanu bebek nei hi. Ama in Egypt mi Jarha kici naseam khat nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuasia pa le a tanute khat teangsak hi. Amate in Attai kici tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Attai khang pan Elishama khang dong sia a nuai a bang ahi hi: Attai, Nathan, Zabad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ephlal, Obed,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jehu, Azariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Helez, Eleasah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sismai, Shallum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jekamiah le Elishama te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jerahmeel ii suapuipa Caleb ii tapa lianbel sia Mesha kici hi. Mesha sia Ziph ii pa, Ziph sia Mareshah ii pa, Mareshah sia Hebron ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hebron in tapa li nei hi: Korah, Tappuah, Rekem le Shema te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Shema sia Raham ii pa hi a, Jorkeam ii pu ahi hi. Shema ii suapuipa Rekem sia Shammai ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Shammai sia Maon ii pa hi a, Maon sia Bethzur ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Caleb in Ephah kici zino khat nei a, tua nu taw tapa thum nei thua hi: Haran, Moza le Gazez te hi. Haran zongh in Gazez kici tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />(Jahdai a kici pa in tapa luk nei hi: Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah le Shaaph te hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Caleb in zino dang Maacah nei in tua nu taw tapa nii nei a, Sheber le Tirhanah te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua nu in tapa nii nei thua a: Madmannah khua saat pa Shaaph; Machbenah le Gibea khua saat pa Shevah ahi uh hi. Caleb in Achsah kici tanu khat nei thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A nuai a teng zongh Caleb ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi. Caleb le a zi Ephrath ii a tapa lianbel sia Hur hi. Hur ii tapa Shobal in Kiriath Jearim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />a tapa niina Salma in Bethlehem khua, tuaciang a tapa thumna Hareph in Bethgader khua saat tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Kiriath Jearim khua a saat Shobal sia Haroeh mite, Menuhoth ah a teangte a lang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />tuaciang Kiriath Jearim ah a teang a nuai a bee le phung teng: Ithri te, Puth te, Shumath te le Mishrai te ii taanghpupi hi. (Zorah le Eshtaol khuapi mite sia hi bee le phungte ii mite hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bethlehem khuasaatpa Salma sia Netophath, Atroth Beth Joab le Zor mite ii taanghpupi hi a, Zor te sia tua Manahath ah a teang bee le phung nam nii sung pan nam khat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />(Jabez khua ah a nuai a lai at thiamte le laikuu thiam bee le phung teng: Tirath, Shimeath le Sucath te teang uh hi. Amate sia Rechab mite taw zi le pasal in a kiman Ken mite ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hebron ah David a ten lai in a nei tapate a kum zui in a nuai a bang ahi hi: Amnon, a nu sia Jezreel pan Ahinoam, Daniel, a nu sia Carmel pan Abigail, Absalom, a nu sia Geshur kumpipa Talmai ii tanu Maacah, Adonijah, a nu sia Haggith, Shephatiah, a nu sia Abital, Ithream, a nu sia Eglah te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A luk ma in David kumpipa ii Hebron ah kum sali le lang ngam a uk sungin a nei tapate ahi uh hi. Ama in Jerusalem ah kum 33 sung kumpi seamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua munah tapa tam mama nei hi. Ammiel ii tanu, a zi Bathsheba taw tapa li toai hi: Shimea, Shobab, Nathan le Solomon te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in tapa dang kua nei hi: Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada le Eliphelet te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi teng zawkciang David in a zinote taw tapa dang zongh nei thua hi. Ama in Tamar kici tanu khat zongh nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa ii suan le paalte, a pa pan kipan tapa dong a khang zui in hi bang hi: Solomon, Rehoboam, Abijah, Asa, Jehoshaphat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehoram, Ahaziah, Joash,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaziah, Uzziah, Jotham,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahaz, Hezekiah, Manasseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amon le Josiah ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josiah in tapa li nei hi: Johanan, Jehoiakim, Zedekiah, le Joahaz te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoiakim in tapa nii nei hi: Jehoiachin le Zedekiah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hite sia Babylon te ii thong ah a khum, Jehoiachin kumpipa ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi. Jehoiachin in tapa sali nei hi: Shealtiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Malchiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama le Nedabiah te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pedaiah in tapa nii nei in, Zerubbabel le Shimei te ahi uh hi. Zerubbabel sia tapa nii ahi, Meshullam le Hananiah te le tanu khat ahi Shelomith te ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a dang tapa nga zongh nei hi: Hashubah, Ohel, Berechiah, Hasadiah le Jushab Hesed te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hananiah in tapa nii nei in, Pelatiah le Jeshaiah te ahi uh hi. Jeshaiah sia Rephaiah ii pa, Rephaiah sia Arnan ii pa, Arnan sia Obadiah ii pa, Obadiah sia Shecaniah ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shecaniah in tapa khat Shemaiah le tupa nga nei hi: Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah le Shaphat te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Neariah in tapa thum nei hi: Elioenai, Hizkiah le Azrikam te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Elioenai in tapa sali nei hi: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah le Anani te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hite sia Judah suan le paalte pawlkhat ahi hi: Perez, Hezron, Carmi, Hur le Shobal te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Shobal sia Reaiah ii pa, Reaiah sia Jahath ii pa, Jahath sia Ahumai le Lahad te ii pa hi a, amate sia Zorah ah a teang mite ii taanghpupite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hur sia Caleb ii a zi Ephrath taw a tapa lianbel hi a, ama suan le paalte sia Bethlehem khuapi saat ciilte ahi uh hi. Hur in tapa thum nei hi: Etam, Penuel le Ezer te ahi hi. Etam in tapa thum nei hi: Jezreel, Ishma le Idbash hi a, Hazzelelponi kici tanu khat nei hi. Penuel in Gedor khuapi saat a, Ezer in Hushah khuapi saat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tekoa khua saatpa Ashhur in zi nii nei a, Helah le Naarah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Naarah taw tapa li nei hi: Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni le Haahashtari te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ashhur le Helah in tapa thum nei hi: Zereth, Izhar le Ethnan te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Koz sia Anub le Zobebah ii pa hi a, Harum tapa Aharhel ii suan bee le phungte ii taanghpupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jabez kici pasal khat om a, ama innkuan sung panin a zatakbel uh ahi hi. A sua lai, a nu in na sa mama ahikom Jabez ci in min phuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang Jabez in Israel te ii Pathian tungah thungen in, “Pathian awng, thupha hong pia ta'n a, ngam zai khat hong pia ta'n. Hong ompui ta'n a kei hong nasak thei tu siatna khat pawpo pan hong keam ta'n,” ci hi. A thunget bangin Pathian in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shuhah ii suapuipa Caleb in tapa Mehir nei hi. Mehir sia Eshton ii pa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eshton in tapa thum nei hi: Bethrapha, Paseah le Tehinnah te ahi hi. Tehinnah sia Nahash khuapi saatpa hi. Hi mite ii suan le paalte sia Recah ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kenaz in tapa nii nei a, Othniel le Seraiah te ahi uh hi. Othniel zongh in tapa nii nei a, Hathath le Meonothai te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meonothai sia Ophrah ii pa hi. Seraiah sia Joab ii pa hi a, nasep thiam mite bebek ii teenna Khutthiamte Kuam a saatpa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jephunneh ii tapa Caleb in tapa thum nei hi: Iru, Elah le Naam te ahi hi. Elah sia Kenaz ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehallelel in tapa li nei hi: Ziph, Ziphah, Tiria, le Asarel te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ezrah in tapa li nei hi: Jether, Mered, Epher, le Jalon te ahi hi. Mered in Egypt kumpipa ii tanu Bithiah teenpui a, amate in Miriam kici tanu khat le tapa nii, Shammai le Ishbah nei uh hi. Ishbah in Eshtemoa khua saat hi. Mered in zongh Judah nam numei khat teenpui in tapa thum nei hi: Gedor khua saatpa Jered; Soco khua saatpa Heber; le Zanoah khua saatpa Jekuthiel te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hodiah in Naham ii suapuinu teenpui hi. A suan a paalte sia Keilah khua ah a teang Garm bee le phung le Eshtemoa khua ah a teang Maacath bee le phung te ii pianna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimon in tapa li nei hi: Amnon, Rinnah, Benhanan, le Tilon te ahi hi. Ishi in tapa nii nei hi: Zoheth le Benzoheth te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Shelah sia Judah ii tapate khat ahi hi. A suan le a paalte sungah Lecah khua saatpa Er; Mareshah khua saatpa Laadah; Beth Ashbea khua ah a teang puanneal thiamtak namte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jokim le Cozeba khua ah a teang mite, tuaciang Moab numeite a teenpui, Bethlehem khua ah a teang Joash le Saraph kihel uh hi. (Hi taangh ngeinate sia lui mama zo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate kumpipa atu in bealseakte hi a, Netaim le Gederah khua te ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simeon in tapa nga nei hi: Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zerah, le Shaul te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Shaul ii tapa Shallum, a tupa Mibsam hi a, a tu selawn sia Mishma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang Mishma ii khangngui sia Hammuel, Zaccur, le Shimei te hi susuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Shimei in tapa sawm le luk le tanu luk nei a, ahihang a mealheakte in ta tawm zaw nei ahikom Simeon nam sia Judah nam za in pung ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />David kumpipa hun dong Simeon suan le paalte sia a nuai a khuate ahi: Beersheba, Moladah, Hazarshual,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bilhah, Ezem, Tolad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bethuel, Hormah, Ziklag,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beth Marcaboth, Hazarsusim, Bethbiri, le Shaaraim ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate a dang mun nga ahi: Etam, Ain, Rimmon, Tochen le Ashan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tuaciang nitumna thangsang Baalath khua dong, a kiim a paam khuanote zongh ah teang uh hi. Hite sia amate ii bangkua thute le a teenna mun le ngamte ii thu le la tepteena ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate bee le phung lutangte sia a nuai a mite ahi hi: Meshobab, Jamlech, Amaziah ii tapa Joshah, Joel, Jehu (Joshibiah ii tapa, Seraiah ii tapa, Asiel ii tapa), Elioenai, Jaakobah Jeshohaiah, Asaiah, Adiel, Jesimiel, Benaiah, Ziza (Shiphi ii tapa, Allon ii tapa, Jedaiah ii suan khat Shimri, le Shemaiah). Amate ii innkuante pung vaial ahikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />nitumna sang Gerar dong phialma in kizel hi, a tuute sia tua khuapi omna kuam ii nisuana sangah tha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in tualai ah ngamthim dide patauna om ngawl, leipha ngantatna mun tam mama mu uh hi, tuate sia ngam awngthongna sungah kithung hi. Tua ngam ah a teang masate sia Ham mite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Hezekiah hun lai in a tungah a ki at mite in Gerar ah pai a, tua munah a teangte ii puanbuk le thaampheang te sathapsak siat uh hi. A tuute atu in lohingna ngam tam ahikom amate in a teang sa te notkeak in tua munah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Simeon nam sung pan a dang mihing za nga nisuana sang Edom ngam zuan uh hi. Amate sia Ishi ii tapate ahi: Pelatiah, Neariah, Rephaiah, le Uzziel te in lampui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Amate in tua munah a nungta lai Amalek mite that a, tua lai ah tua hun panin teang suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hite sia Jacob ii tapa lianbel Reuben ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi. (Reuben in a pa zinote khat khialpui ahikom taciil ii innlua za taan in, a lua tu teng sia Joseph kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahizong Judah nam sia a hatbel hi a, a nam theampo atu ukpa khat ii pianna ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jacob ii tapa lianbel Reuben in tapa li nei hi: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, le Carmi te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hite sia khang khat zawkciang khang khat Joel ii suan le paalte ahi hi: Shemaiah, Gog, Shimei, Micah, Reaiah, Baal, le Beerah te ahi hi. Assyria kumpilianpa Tiglath Pileser in a nam lampuipa Beerah manin a ngam pan mun dangah hawlkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Reuben nam sungah a nuai a, bee le phung lampuite min teng innkuan khangngui sungah kiciamtee hi: Jeiel, Zechariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuaciang, Azaz ii tapa, Shema ii tupa Bela hi a, ama sia Joel ii bee le phung pan ahi hi. Hi bee le phung sia Aroer khua le a saksang Nebo le Baal Meon ngam sungah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Gilead ngam ah nganno honpite nei ahikom Euphrates ngundung suk theampo, nisuana sang sennealngam dongin sungsuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul kumpipa hun sung Reuben namte in Hagri te ngal sungah a thalup zawkciang Gilead nisuana sang amate ngam teng la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gad minamte sia Reuben namte ii teenna saksang Bashan ngam sungah nisuana sang Salecah dongin teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joel sia a puiding bee le phung pianna hi a, Shapham sia bee le phung a thupibel a niina sia ii pianna ahi hi. Janai le Shaphat te sia Bashan ngam ah a teang bee le phung dangte ii pian nate ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua Gad nam sung pan bee le phung dang salite a nuai a bang ahi hi: Michael, Meshullam, Sheba, Jorai, Jacan, Zia, le Eber te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate Huri ii tapa Abihail ii suan le paalte hi in, a taanghpupite a nuai a bang ahi hi: Abihail, Huri, Jaroah, Gilead, Michael, Jeshishai, Jahdo, Buz te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abdiel ii tapa, Guni ii tupa Ahi sia hi bee le phungte ii lutang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate Bashan le Gilead ngamsung khua teng le Sharon ngam nganthana munte theampo ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />(Hi thu tepteenate sia Judah kumpipa Jotham le Israel kumpipa Jeroboam II khan lai in a kikaikhawm thute veu hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Reuben, Gad le Manasseh nisuana sang minamte sungah lum, namsau, le thal a zanghthiam ngalkap 44,760 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Jetur, Naphish le Nodab nam ahi Hagri minamte sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in Pathian muangin a huu natu thungen ahikom Pathian in a thu ngetna sang a, Hagri le a pawlte zosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in ngalte ii kalaoh 50,000, tuu 250,000, le laa 2000 matsakin ngalte 100,000 man uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ngal simna sia Pathian ii deina ahikom amate in ngalte tam mama that uh hi. Amate sia saltaang tu in a kipaipui dong tua ngam ah teang suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Manasseh Nisuana sang mite sia Bashan ngamsung saksangah Baal Hermon, Senir, le Hermon mual dongin teang a, pung mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate ii bee le phung lutangte sia: Epher, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah le Jahdiel te ahi hi. Amate theampo sia ngalkap mindok tuam te le bee le phung lampui minthangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang hi mite in a taanghpupite ii Pathian tungah thumaan ngawlin a ngam pan Pathian ii a nawkeak minamte ii pathiante bia tu in Pathian taisan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in Assyria kumpilianpa Pul (Tiglath Pileser zong kici) in a ngam simsak hi. Pul kumpipa in Reuben, Gad, le Manasseh Nisuana sang minam teng notkeak a, Halah, Habor, le Hara, tuaciang Gozan ngunhui ah teang suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levi in tapa thum nei a: Gershon, Kohath, le Merari te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kohath in tapa li nei a: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amram in tapa nii, Aaron, Moses, le tanu khat, Miriam nei hi. Aaron in tapa li nei a: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazar ii suan le paalte khang khat pan khang khat a nuai a bang hi a: Phinehas, Abishua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bukki, Uzzi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerahiah, Meraioth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amariah, Ahitub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zadok, Ahimaaz,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azariah, Johanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azariah (Jerusalem ah Solomon kumpipa ii sak Biakinnpi sungah naseam pa)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amariah, Ahitub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zadok, Shallum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hilkiah, Azariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seraiah, Jehozadak te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in Jehozadak sia Topa ii saltaang tu in a puak Judah le Jerusalem pan midangte taw a ngam pan not khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi in tapa thum nei a: Gershon, Kohath, le Merari te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate zongh in tapa nei tek uh hi. Gershon sia Libni le Shimei ii pa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath sia Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel ii pa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari sia Mahli le Mushi ii pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hite sia Gershon ii khang khat pan khang khat a suan a paalte hi a: Libni, Jahath, Zimmah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joah, Iddo, Zerah, Jeatherai te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hite sia Kohath ii khang khat pan khang khat a suan a paalte hi a: Amminadab, Korah, Assir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elkanah, Ebiasaph, Assir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tahath, Uriel, Uzziah, Shaul te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elkanah in tapa nii nei a, Amasai le Ahimoth ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hite sia Ahimoth ii khang khat pan khang khat a suan a paalte hi a: Elkanah, Zophai, Nahath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eliab, Jeroham, Elkanah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuel in tapa nii nei a: a upa sia Joel hi in a naupa sia Abijah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hite sia Merari ii khang khat pan khang khat a suan a paalte hi a: Mahli, Libni, Shimei, Uzzah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Shimea, Haggiah, Asaiah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi mite sia Jerusalem ah Thuciamna Thingkuang a kikhiin zawkciang Jerusalem biakna munah music tumtheite a uk tu in David kumpipa ii a koi pasalte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa ii Biakinnpi a sak ma hunsung in Topa ompuina Puanbuk sungah amate in a huhun in kilaih a, vaipuak la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi zum a len amate ii innkuan khangsimna sia a nuai a bang hi a: Kohath bee le phung sung panin: Joel ii tapa Heman sia lasa pawl khatna lampui pa ahi hi. Heman ii innkuan khang ngui sia a nuai a bangin Jacob dong kilee sim a: Heman, Joel, Samuel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elkanah, Jeroham, Eliel, Toah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zuph, Elkanah, Mahath, Amasai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elkanah, Joel, Azariah, Zephaniah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tahath, Assir, Ebiasaph, Korah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Izhar, Kohath, Levi, Jacob te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Asaph sia lasa pawl niina lampui pa ahi hi. Ama innkuan khang ngui sia a nuai a bangin Levi dong kilee sim a: Asaph, Berechiah, Shimea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Michael, Baaseiah, Malchijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ethni, Zerah, Adaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ethan, Zimmah, Shimei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jahath, Gershon, Levi te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Merari bee le phung sung pan Ethan in lasa pawl thumna lampui pa ahi hi. Ama innkuan khang ngui sia a nuai a bangin Levi dong kilee sim a: Ethan, Kishi, Abdi, Malluch,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hashabiah, Amaziah, Hilkiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amzi, Bani, Shemer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mahli, Mushi, Merari, Levi te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amate ii a mipui Levi mite sia biakna munah nasep dangte theampo a kiseamsakte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aaron le a suan a paalte in ngimnamtui biakpiaknate pia in biaknatau tungah a kihal sangaw biakpiaknate pia uh hi. Thiangthobel Mun ah biakna theampo atu le Pathian ii Israel te mawna khialna a maisak natu in sangaw biakpiaknate atu sia amate nasep hi. Amate in hi nasep teng sia Pathian naseampa Moses ii thupiak nate bangin seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Aaron ii suan le paalte khang ngui sia: Eleazer, Phinehas, Abishua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bukki, Uzzi, Zerahiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Meraioth, Amariah, Ahitub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Zadok, Ahimaaz te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hi ngam sia Kohath ii bee le phung, Aaron ii suan le paalte tungah a kipia ngam hi. Amate in Levi te tungah hawmtel a kipia masabel leitang sia nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Judah ngamsung Hebron le a kiim a om nganthana munte hi sungah kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ahitazong khuapi neisa lote le khuanote sia Jephunneh ii tapa Caleb pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A nuai a khua teng Aaron suan le paalte kipia a: bukna khuapi khat ahi Hebron, Jattir le Libnah, Eshtemoa, Hilen, Debir, Ashan, le Beth Shemesh khuate hi a, tuate nganthanate zongh taw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Benjamin ngam sungah amate atu in a nuai a khuate, a nganthana munte taw kipia khawm a: Geba, Alemeth, le Anathoth te ahi hi. Amate innkuan teng theampo ten natu in a vekpi in khua sawm le khua thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Manasseh nitumna ngam sungah a om khua sawm sia Kohath ii bee le phung a taanglaite tungah innkuan zui in lai meetang sawksak a kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Gershon bee le phungte tungah innkuan zui in Issachar, Asher, Naphtali le Bashan ngam ah Manasseh nisuana ngamte sungah a om khua sawm le khua thum kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tuabang ma in Merari bee le phungte tungah a innkuan zui in Reuben, Gad, le Zebulun ngam te sungah a om khua sawm le khua nii kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Hi bangin Israel mite in Levi te tungah a ten natu in khuate le a kiim ah a om nganthana munte taw pia khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />(A tungah a kison Judah, Simeon le Benjamin ngam te sungah a om khuate zongh lai meetang sawkin kihawmsak hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Kohath bee le phung innkuan pawlkhatte tungah Ephraim ngam ah a om khuate le nganthana munte kipia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Ephraim mualtung a om bukna khuapi ahi Shechem, Gezer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jokmeam, Beth Horon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Aijalon, le Gath Rimmon te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Amate sia Manasseh Nitumna ngam sungah Aner le Bileam khuate le a kiim a om nganthana munte kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Gershon bee le phung innkuante tungah a nuai a khuate le a kiim a om nganthana munte kipia a: Manasseh Nisuana ngamsung pan: Bashan ah Golan le Ashtaroth khua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Issachar ngam sungah: Kedesh, Daberath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Ramoth le Anem khua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Asher ngam sungah: Mashal, Abdon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Hukok, le Rehob khua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Naphtali ngam sungah: Galilee pan Kedesh, Hammon, le Kiriathaim khua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />A taanglai Merari bee le phung innkuante tungah a nuai a khuate le a kiim a om nganthana munte kipia a: Zebulun ngam sungah: Rimono le Tabor khua ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Reuben ngamsung pan, Jericho ngalkhat Jordan ngun nisuana sang ah: Jahzah mualzaangtam tungah a om Bezer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Kedemoth, le Mephaath ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Gad ngamsung pan: Gilead ah Ramoth, Mahanaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Heshbon le Jazer ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Issachar in tapa li nei a: Tola, Puah, Jashub, le Shimron te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tola in tapa luk nei a: Uzzi, Rephaiah, Jeriel, Jahmai, Ibsam, le Shemuel te ahi hi. Amate Tola bee le phung sung innkuan lutangte vive hi in ngalkap minthangte ahi uh hi. Amate suan le paal sia David kumpipa hun lai in 22,600 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzzi in tapa khat nei a, Izrahiah hi. Izrahiah le a tapa lite ahi, Michael, Obadiah, Joel, le Isshiah te a vekpi in innkuan lutangte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in zi tam mama le ta tam mama nei a, a suan a paalte ngalkap seam thei 36,000 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Issachar nam innkuante theampo zum laibu sungah ngalkap seam thei pasal 87,000 om hi ci in kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Benjamin in tapa thum nei a: Bela, Becher, le Jediael te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bela in tapa nga nei a: Ezbon, Uzzi, Uzziel, Jerimoth le Iri te ahi hi. Amate sia bee le phung sung innkuan lutangte le ngalkap minthangte vive ahi uh hi. A suan a paal ngalkap seam thei pasal 22,034 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Becher in tapa kua nei a: Zemirah, Joash, Eliezer, Eleoenai, Omri, Jeremoth, Abijah, Anathoth le Alemeth te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zum laibu sungah a suan a paalte a innkuan zui in a tepteena ah ngalkap seam thei pasal 20,200 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jediael in tapa khat Bilhan nei a, Bilhan in tapa sali nei a: Jeush, Benjamin, Ehud, Chenaanah, Zethan, Tarshish, le Ahishahar te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate theampo sia bee le phung sung innkuan lutangte le ngalkap minthangte veu ahi uh hi. Amate ii suan le paal sungah ngalkap seam thei pasal 17,200 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Shuppim le Huppim zongh hi namte ahi hi. Dan in tapa khat, Hushim nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naphtali in tapa li nei a: Jahziel, Guni, Jezer, le Shallum te ahi hi. (Amate sia Bilhah ii suan le paalte ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh in a zino Aramean taw tapa nii nei in, Asriel le Machir te ahi uh hi. Machir sia Gilead ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Machir in Huppim le Shuppim zi khat veve neisak hi. Ama suapuinu ii min Maacah hi. Machir ii tapa niina sia Zelophehad hi a, ama in tanu bek nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Machir ii zi Maacah in tapa nii nei a, Peresh le Sheresh ci in min phuak hi. Peresh in tapa nii nei a, Ulam le Rakem te ahi uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ulam in Bedan kici tapa khat nei hi. Hite theampo sia Machir ii tapa, Manasseh ii tupa ahi Gilead suan le paalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gilead suapuinu Hammolecheth in tapa thum nei a: Ishod, Abiezer, le Mahlah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Shemida in tapa li nei a: Ahian, Shechem, Likhi, le Aniam te ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hite sia Ephraim ii a khang a khangin a suan le a paalte hi: Shuthelah, Bered, Tahath, Eleadah, Tahath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zabad, Shuthelah te ahi uh hi. Ephraim in Shuthelah ngawl tapa dang nii nei a: Ezer le Elead te ahi hi, amate sia Gath khua mite ii khui ngu tu in a kipat laitakin kithatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate ii pa Ephraim sia ni tam ma khuangai in kap a, a heeneam tu in a mealheakte pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a zi luppui kik a, a zi ngai in tapa khat nei hi. A innkuan sungah ngimna theng ahikom a tapa min Beriah phuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ephraim in Sheerah kici tanu khat nei hi. Sheerah in Beth Horon Tungnung le Nuainung khuate le Uzzen Sheerah khua saat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ephraim zongh in Rephah kici tapa khat nei in, a suan a paalte a nuai a bang hi: Resheph, Telah, Tahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ladan, Ammihud, Elishama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nun, Joshua te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate ii a laak le a teenna ngam sia Bethel le a kiim ah om khua teng, nisuana sang panin Naaran dong, nitumna sang panin Gezer le a kiim a khuate dong kihel hi. Shechem le Ayyah khuapite le a kiim ah khuate zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Manasseh suan le paalte in Beth Shean, Taanach, Megiddo le Dor, le a kiim ah khuate uk hi. Hite theampo Jacob ii tapa Joseph ii suan le paalte teenna munte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hite sia Asher ii suan le paalte hi. Asher in tapa li nei a: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah te hi a; tuaciang Serah kici tanu khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beriah in tapa nii nei in, Heber le Malchiel te ahi uh hi. (Malchiel in Birzaith khuapi saat hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Heber in tapa thum nei a: Japhlet, Shomer, le Hotham te hi a; tuaciang Shua kici tanu khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Japhlet zongh in tapa thum nei a: Pasach, Bimhal, le Ashvath te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A suapuipa Shomer in tapa thum nei a: Rohgah, Jehubbah, le Aram te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A suapuipa Hotham in tapa li nei a: Zophah, Imna, Shelesh, le Amal te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zophah suan le paalte sia Suah, Harnepher, Shual, Beri, Imrah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bezer, Hod, Shamma, Shilshah, Ithran, Beera te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jether ii suan le paalte sia Jephunneh, Pispa le Ara,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuaciang Ulla ii suan le paalte sia Arah, Hanniel, Rizia te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hite theampo sia Asher ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi. Amate sia innkuan lutangte veu hi in, ngalsim minthang le lampui thiamte veu ahi uh hi. Asher ii suan le paalte sungah ngalkap seam thei pasal 26,000 om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin in tapa nga nei hi. A piankum zui in Bela, Ashbel, Aharah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nohah le Rapha te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bela ii suan le paalte sia Addar, Gera, Abihud,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gera, Shephuphan, Huram te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ehud ii suan le paalte sia Naaman, Ahijah le Gera te ahi uh hi. Amate sia Geba khua a teang innkuante ii lutangte ahitazong amate kinot in, Manahath ah teang tu in pai uh hi. Hi sungah Uzza le Ahihud ii pa Gera in amate lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Shaharaim in a zite nii Hushim le Baara khul hi. Tua zawk, Moab ngam ah a ten ciang ama in Hodesh teenpui in tapa sali nei a: Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeuz, Sachia, le Mirmah te ahi hi. A tapate theampo sia innkuan lungtangte veu suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Hushim taw zong tapa nii nei a: Abitub le Elpaal te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elpaal in tapa thum nei a: Eber, Misham, le Shemed te ahi hi. Shemed sia Ono le Lod khuapite le a kiim ah khuanote a saat pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beriah le Shema sia Aijalon khuapi ah a teang innkuan lutangte veve hi a, Gath khuapi ah a teang mite notkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beriah ii suan le paalte sungah Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Michael, Ishpah, le Joha te kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elpaal ii suan le paalte sungah Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ishmerai, Izliah le Jobab te kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Shimei ii suan le paalte sungah Jakim, Zichri, Zabdi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adaiah, Beraiah le Shimrath te kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shashak ii suan le paalte sungah Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abdon, Zichri, Hanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Iphdeiah le Penuel te kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeroham ii suan le paalte sungah Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaareshiah, Elijah le Zichri te kihel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hite sia innkuante ii a taangh lutangte hi a, amate ii a suan le paal bulpite sia Jerusalem ah a teangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeiel in Gibeon khuapi saatin tua khua ah teang hi. A zi sia Maacah hi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a tapa lianbel sia Abdon hi. A tapa dangte sia Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zecher,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />le Shimeah ii pa Mikloth te ahi uh hi. A suan a paalte sia Jerusalem khua, a bee le phung sung innkuan dangte naina ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ner sia Kish ii pa hi a, Kish sia Saul kumpipa ii pa hi. Saul in tapa li nei a: Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab le Eshbaal te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathan sia Meribbaal ii pa hi a, Meribbaal sia Micah ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Micah in tapa li nei a: Pithon, Melech, Tarea le Ahaz te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahaz sia Jehoaddah ii pa, tapa thum ii pa hi a: Alemeth, Azmaveth le Zimri te ahi uh hi. Zimri sia Moza ii pa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Moza sia Binea ii pa, Binea sia Raphah ii pa, Raphah sia Eleasah ii pa hi a, Eleasah sia Azel ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azel in tapa luk nei a: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, le Hanan te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azel ii suapuipa Eshek in tapa thum nei a: Ulam, Jeush, le Eliphelet te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ulam ii tapate sia ngalkap thiamte le thalkaap thiamte veu ahi uh hi. Ama in tapa le tupa a vekpi in 150 nei hi. A tungah min omte theampo sia Benjamin namte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite theampo a innkuan zui in kiciamtee a, tuate Israel Kumpite Laibu sungah kikhum hi. Judah mite sia amate mawna hangin daan piakna in Babylon ah saltaang tu in kihawlkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapi te sung amate ii neisa omna ah a heakkik masa belte sia Israel ngammite, thiampite, Levi te le Biakinn naseamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah, Benjamin, Ephraim le Manasseh nam te sung pan mihingte Jerusalem ah teang tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem ah a teang Judah nam pan innkuan 690 pha hi. Judah ii tapa Perez suan le paalte ii lampuipa sia Uthai hi a, Uthai sia Ammihud ii tapa, Omri ii tupa hi. Ama taanghpupi dangte sungah Imri le Bani te kihel hi. Judah ii tapa Shelah suan le paalte lampuipa sia Asaiah hi a, amate innkuan ii lutang hi. Judah ii tapa Zerah ii suan le paalte lampuipa sia Jeuel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin, nam sung panin a nuai a teng Jerusalem ah teang a: Meshullam ii tapa Sallu hi a, ama sia Hodaviah ii tapa hi, Hodaviah sia Hassenuah ii tapa hi. Jeroham ii tapa Ibneiah Elah sia Uzzi ii tapa, Michri ii tupa Shephatiah ii tapa Meshullam hi a, ama sia Reuel ii tapa hi Reuel sia Ibnijah ii tapa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua mun ah teang hi nam sung pan innkuan 956 om hi. A tungah min a ki atte theampo sia innkuan lutangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nuai a thiampite Jerusalem ah teang a: Jedaiah, Jehoiarib, le Jachin, Hilkiah ii tapa Azariah (Biakinnpi a ukpipa) a taanghpupite sungah Meshullam, Zadok, Meraioth le Ahitub te kihel hi. Jeroham ii tapa Adaiah, a taanghpupite sungah Pashhur le Malchijah kihel hi. Adiel ii tapa Maasai, a taanghpupite sungah Jahzerah, Meshullam, Meshillemith le Immer te kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Innkuante ii lutangte ahi thiampite a vekpi in 1,760 pha uh hi. Amate sia Biakinnpi taw kisai nasep theampo a thiam mamate ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nuai a Levi te Jerusalem ah teang a: Hasshub ii tapa Shemaiah, a taanghpupite sungah Merari bee le phung sung pan Azrikam le Hashabiah kihel hi. Bakbakkar, Heresh, le Galal Mica ii tapa Mattaniah, a taanghpupite sungah Zichri le Asaph te kihel hi. Shemaiah ii tapa Obadiah, a taanghpupite sungah Galal le Jeduthun te kihel hi. Berechiah sia Asa ii tapa, Elkanah ii tupa sia hi a, Netophah khua ii ngam sungah teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nuai a biakinn cingte Jerusalem ah teang a: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, le Ahiman te hi. Shallum sia amate lampuipa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun dongin amate ii bee le phung teng Kumpipa Kongpi tumna nisuana sangah ki omsak hi. Amate in nidang in Levi te ngiaphual kongpite cing uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kore ii tapa le Ebiasaph ii tupa, Shallum sia Korah ii bee le phung puite taw Topa ompuina Puanbuk tumna a cingpa hi a, a taanghpupite ii Topa ngiaphual a uk hunlai bangma in cing uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eleazar ii tapa Phineas in amate khatvei lai in uk hi. — Topa in ama taw om tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshelemiah ii tapa Zechariah zongh Topa ompuina Puanbuk tumna a cingpa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua tumna te le kongpite a cing tu a vekpi in mihing 212 kiteal hi. Amate sia a teenna khuanote zui in kiciamtee hi. David kumpipa le kamsaang Samuel in a taanghpupite hi bang nasep thupite seamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate le a suan a paalte in Biakinnpi kongpite cing tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saksang, thangsang, nisuana le nitumna sangah kongpi khat tek om in, a cing a ukpi zongh khat tek om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi kongcingte sia khuano a teang amate mealheak te in hu a, ni sali ciang khatvei kilaih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kongcing ukpi li sia Levi te hi a, vaipuak nei belte ahi uh hi. Amate in Biakinnpi sung inndoite le a sungah a om vanhte kep tu zongh vaipuak nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in Biakinnpi cin tu le zing sim kongpite hon tu vaipuak nei ahikom Biakinnpi nai ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levi dangte in biakna ah a kizangh uum le bealte kep tu vaipuak nei uh hi. Amate in tua vanhte a kizak sim le a koi kik ciangin sim vaciat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A dangte in biakna taw kisai a thiangtho vanh le, anvui, sapittui, olive thau, ngimnamtui le hel namtuite keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang hel namtuite hel tu sia thiampite vaipuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Korah ii bee le phung pan Shallum ii tapa lianbel Mattithiah kici Levipa ii nasep sia anluum em biakpiakna sia vawtkhol tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kohath bee le phung sung pan mite in Sabbath ni sim Biakinnpi atu anluum thiangtho vawt tu vaipuak nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Levi innkuan pawlkhat in biakinn ah tumtheite tum tu vaipuak nei hi. Hi innkuan te ii lutangte biakinn huang sung inn pawlkhat te sungah teang uh a, a sun a zanin nasep a nei uh hu in nasep dang bangma kipia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A tung a, a kison pasal te sia a pu a pa khangngui zui in Levi te ii innkuan lutangte veu ahi uh hi. Amate sia Jerusalem ah a teang lampuite hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jeiel in Gibeon khuapi saatin tua munah teang hi. A zi sia Maacah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A tapa lianbel Abdon hi in, a tapa dangte Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah, le Mikloth te hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mikloth sia Shimeah ii pa hi. A suan a paalte amate bee le phung pan innkuan dangte naina Jerusalem ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ner sia Kish ii pa hi a, Kish sia Saul ii pa hi. Saul in tapa li nei a: Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab le Eshbaal te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathan sia Meribbaal ii pa hi a, Meribbaal sia Micah ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Micah in tapa li nei a: Pithon, Melech, Tarea, le Ahaz te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahaz sia Jarah ii pa hi a, Jarah sia tapa thum ii pa hi a: Alemeth, Azmaveth, le Zimrite ahi hi. Zimri sia Moza ii pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moza sia Binea ii pa, Binea sia Rephaiah ii pa, Rephaiah sia Eleasah ii pa, Eleasah sia Azel ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azel in tapa luk nei a: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, le Hanan te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistine mite in Israel te Gilboa mual tungah sim uh hi. Israel te tam mama tua munah kithatlum in a taanglai teng, Saul kumpipa le a tapate zongh tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang Philistine te in amate delin pha a Saul ii tapate thum, Jonathan, Abinadab le Malchisua te thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul ii omna kiim ah kidona nasia in, ama ngalte thaltangte in kha a, nasia takin liam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in ama ngalhiamte a pua tangvalpa tungah, “Pathian sel Philistine te ii hong simmawk vawt ngawl natu in na namsau dokin hong that ka heu in,” ci hi. Ahihang tuabang ahi tu sia tangvalpa lau mama in seam ngam ngawl hi. Tua ahikom Saul in ama namsau la in a namsau tungah kisepsuk in thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangvalpa in Saul ii thi a mu ciang ama zongh a namsau tungah kisepsuk in thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangin Saul le a tapate thum sia mun khat ah thi khawm siatin, a suan a paalte kuama in ngam uk ngei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jezreel Kuam ah a teang Israel mite in ngalkaphonpi a taimang le Saul le a tapate a thi a zaak uh ciangin a khuate nusia in taimang uh hi. Tuasia ciang Philistine te pai in a khuate suan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngal kisim khuavak ni in a thite ii vanh la tu in a pai Philistine te in Saul le a tapate ii luang Gilboa mual tungah mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Saul lu tan in a ngaldalna suutsak a, Philistia ngam bup ah a mite le a milimte tungah hi lungdamna thu ko tu in kamtaite paisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a biakinnte khat ii sungah Saul ii ngalhiamte koi a, a lutang sia Dagon pathian biakinn sungah khai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead ngam Jebesh mite in Philistine te ii Saul tungah a vawtna thu a zaak uh ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ngalhang belte va pai a, Saul le a tapate ii luangte la in Jabesh khua ah ciapui uh hi. Amate in oak thingkung khat ii nuai ah a luangte phumin ni sali sung an tang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah a thumaan ngawl hangin Saul thi hi. Ama in Topa thupiakte zui ngawl hi; ama in lamlakna a zonna in mithite thaate tungah thudok tu hanciam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa tungah thu dongh ngawl zaw hi. Tua ahikom Topa in ama thatin Jesse ii tapa David tungah ngamukna za pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite theampo David omna Hebron ah pai in ama tungah “Ko sia nangma ii chi le na sa ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu masia Saul ii kote kumpi a sep lai ngawngawn zonghin Israel mite nangma in ngalsimna ah na lampui a, a mite lampui tu le uk tu in Topa na Pathian in nang tungah kamciam hong pia zo hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom, David kumpipa omna Hebron ah Israel lampuite theampo pai uh hi. Ama in amate taw Pathian mai ah a thiangtho kipawlna khat vawt hi, Samuel tungtawn a Topa ii kamciamsa om bangin amate in David sathau noai in Israel kumpi suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David kumpipa le Israel mite theampo pai in Jerusalem khuapi sim uh hi. Tualai in Jerusalem khuapi sia Jebus kici a tua munah a teang masa Jebus te ma teang lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jebus mite in David tungah, khuapi sungah tum zo ngeingawl tu ni hi ci uh hi, ahihang David in amate Zion kulh sia la a, tuasia “David ii Khuapi” ci in kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in, “Jebus mi khat a thatlum masa belpa ngalkaphonpi ukpa suak tu hi!” ci hi. A nu Zeruiah ahi Joab in ngalsimna ah lampui a, ama sia ngalkapmang suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua kulh huang sungah David pai in teang ahikom tua sia “David ii Khuapi” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in tua mual ii nisuana sang lei kidimna mun pan kipanin khuapi sa kik a, Joab in khuapi sungah puua tu a om lai teng puuapha kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ompui ahikom David a thahat vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hite in David ii ngalkap minthangte ahi uh hi. Amate in Israel mi a om lai teng taw kipawl in, Topa kamciamna omsa bangin, ama kumpi a sua natu in hu uh a, a kumpi ngam thahatsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A masa belpa sia Hachmon bee le phung pan “Mihing Thumte” ii lampuipa Jashobeam ahi hi. Ama in a teipi taw a ngalte 300 sim a, sim khatin that siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mihing Thumte” sung pan a minthang kik pa sia Ahoh bee le phung pan Dodo ii tapa Eleazar hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Pas Dammim ngal kisimna ah David sang pan pangin Philistine te sim hi. Israel te taikeak tu a kipat laitakin ama mangtaang lo sungah om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuabangin ama le a mite sia lo lai ah dinmun la in Philistine te do uh hi. Topa in ama ngalzawna lianpi pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Philistine ngalkapte Rephraim Kuam ah ngiaphual saatin a om laitak ngalkap lampui 30 sung pan thum sia Adullam suanghawng nai David omna suangpi khat ii kungah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin David sia kulh taw ki uum mualtung khat ah om a, Bethlehem khua sia Philistine te pawlkhat in la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in inn sang ngai in, “Bethlehem kongpi hui tuikhuk panin ka dawn tu tui, khat in hong puak le paw uk na peu ing!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngalkap minthang thumte pai in Philistine ngiaphual nawktan a tua tuikhuk pan tui tawm toai in David puak uh hi. Ahizong tua tui ama in dawn ngawl hi; Topa biakpiakna in bua a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hi tui ka ne ngei buatu hi! Tuasia a nuntakna a khaam, hi mite ii chi neak taw kibang tu hi!” ci hi. Tuabangin ama in tui neak tu nial hi. Hite sia a minthang ngalkap thumte ii ngalhan nasepte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab ii suapuipa Abishai sia, “A Minthang Sawmthumte” lampuipa hi. Ama in a teipi taw mihing 300 that a, “Sawmthumte” sungah a minthang suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama, “Sawmthumte” sungah minthang belh a amate lampui suak hi, ahizong, “Mihing Thumte” minthan za in minthang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kabzeel ah Jehoiada ii tapa Benaiah sia ngalkap minthang khat hi a; ama in ngalhan nasep tam mama seamin Moab te ngalhang mama nii zongh that hi. Khatvei vuuk taak ni khat in ama leidum sungah tuaksuk a tawpi khat that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in tei lian mama khat a toai metre 2 vaal a saang mihing thatang lian Egypt te khat zongh that hi. Tua pa sia Benaiah in Egypt pa moltum taw simin a khut sung pan a teipi a suu zawkciang, tua tei taw ama that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuate sia Benaiah ii ngalhan nasepte hi a, ama “Sawmthum” sungah khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama sia “Sawmthum” sungah a mindok tuam khat hi a, ahizong “Mihing Thumte” za in minthang ngawl hi. David in ama sia ama a cingte a uk tu in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hite sia a dang ngalkap mindok tuamte veu hi a: Joab ii suapuipa Asahel Bethlehem pan Dodo ii tapa Elhanan Harod pan Shammoth Pelet pan Helez Tekoa pan Ikkesh ii tapa Ira Anathoth pan Abiezer Hushah pan Sibbecai Ahoh pan Ilai Netophah pan Maharai Netophah pan Baanah ii tapa Heled Benjamin ngam Gibeah pan Ribai ii tapa Ithai Pirathon pan Benaiah Gaash paam kuamte pan Hurai Arbah pan Abiel Bahurum pan Azmaveth Shaalbon pan Eliahba Gizon pan Hashem Harar pan Shagee ii tapa Jonathan Harar pan Sachar ii tapa Ahiam Ur ii tapa Eliphal Mecherah pan Hepher Pelon pan Ahijah Carmel pan Hezro Ezbai ii tapa Naarai Nathan suapuipa Joel Hagri ii tapa Mibhar Ammon pan Zelek Beeroth pan Joab ii ngalhiam puapa Naharai Jattir pan Ira le Gareb Hit mi Uriah Ahlai ii tapa Zabad Shiza ii tapa Adina (ama sia Reuben nam pan a lampui khat hi in, ngalkap 30 nei hi.) Maacah ii tapa Hanan Mithan pan Joshaphat Ashterah pan Uzzia Aroer pan Hotham ii tapate, Shamma le Jeiel Tiz pan Shimri ii tapate, Jediael le Joha Mahavah pan Eliel Elnaam ii tapate, Jeribai le Joshaviah Moab pan Ithmah Zobah pan Eliel, Obed le Jaasiel te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul kumpipa khut sung pan suakta tu in a tai na, Ziklag ah David teang hi. Tualai ah ama sia ngalsim ngeisa, a muanhuai ngalkapte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul pianna Benjamin namte in pawm uh hi. Amate in a khut ziatsang zongh, a veisang zongh taw thal le saili kap khawm thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate sia Gibeah pan Shemaah ii tapate ahi Ahiezer le Joash te ii ukna nuai ah om uh hi. Hite sia a ngalkapte ahi uh hi: Azmaveth ii tapate Jeziel le Pelet, Anathoth pan Beracah le Jehu Ngalkap minthang khat le, “Sawmthum” sungah lampui khat ahi Gibeon pan Ishmaiah Gederah pan Jeremiah, Jahaziel, Johannan le Jozabad Hariph pan Eluzai, Jerimoth, Bealiah, Shemariah, le Shephatiah Korah bee le phung pan Elkanah, Isshiah, Azarel, Joezer, le Jashobeam Gedor pan Jeroham ii tapate Joelah le Zebadiah te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hite sia David ii sennealngam kulh ah a om laitakin ama ngalkapte a pawm Gad nam sung panin ngalkap minthang le ngal sim ngeite ii minte ahi hi. Amate lum le tei zak thiamin, tawpi bangin kiitakhuai a, mualtung sathak bangin a tai ngang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate a za letna zui in a nuai a bang hi a: Ezer, Obadiah, Eliab, Mishmannah, Jeremiah, Attai, Eliel, Johanan, Elzabad, Jeremiah, le Machbannai te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi Gad nam pan pawlkhat ngalkap tulkhat uk ngalkapmang liante hi a, a dangte sia ngalkap zakhat uk ngalkapmang nozawte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kum khat ii tha masabel hun Jordan nguntui pawmin a vaalbo ah tui a let lai in amate in ngun kaantan a ngun ii nisuana sang le nitumna sang kuamte ah a teang mite kithethaangsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khatvei lai in Benjamin le Judah namte sung pan pasal honkhat David omna kulh ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in amate muakin, “Keima hu tu ka lawm te bangin hong pai na hi uh le hong muak khi hi. Ih kipawl tu hi! Ahihang ka ngalte kungah nong zuak tu uh le keima in hong nasak ngawl tu ka hi hang, ih taanghpupite ii Pathian in he tu a, note daan hong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khatvei ciangin “Sawmthum” te lampui a suakpa, amate sung pan khat ahi Amasai sia Pathian thaa in uk a, ama in, “Jesse ii tapa David awng, kote sia nangma mi ka hi uh hi! Nang tung le nangma hong hute tungah zawna om tahen! Nang sang ah Pathian om hi,” ci in a nging in au hi. David in amate phatvawt in, a ngalkap bute suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David le Philistine mite ii Saul kumpipa do tu in a kuan lai in Manasseh nam sung pan ngalkap pawlkhat David ii sangah tai uh hi. A tatakin ama in Philistine te hu ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Philistine kumpite in ama ii a topa masa ahi Saul tungah amate a zuak tu a lau hu in Ziklag ah heak kiksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hite sia Ziklag ah David a heak kik lai in David sang a tai Manasseh nam sung pan ngalkapte hi a: Adnah, Jozabad, Jediael, Michael, Jozabad, Elihu, le Zillethai te ahi hi. Manasseh nam sungah amate theampo sia mi tulkhat ukte veu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate a vekpi ngalkap thiamte veu ahi uh komin David ii ngalkap bute veu suak uh hi. A khak sang ciangin amate sia Israel ngalkap bute veu suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni sim phialin David ngalkapte sungah mithak tum ahikom hai ngawlin ama ngalkaphonpi sia lian mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa kamciamsa bangin Hebron ah David a om lai in, Saul taangin ama kumpi a sua natu in a hu, ngalsim a sinsa ngalkap tam mama in ama ii ngalkaphonpi sia pawm uh hi. A mi phaza a nuai a bang hi: Judah: ngalvanh kicing taw lum le tei toai pasal 6,800; Simeon: ngalkap thiam sa pasal 7,100; Levi: pasal 4,600; Aaron suan Jehoiada ii nungzuite pasal 3,700; Ngalsim thei khangno khat ahi Zadok ii mealheakte: lampui pasal 22; Benjamin (Saul ii nam): pasal 3,000 (Benjamin mite a tamzaw sia Saul tungah thumaan top uh hi); Ephraim: amate bee le phungte sungah a minthang pasal 20,800; Nitumna sang Manasseh panin: David kumpi a suaksak tu in, a kiteal pasal 18,000: Issachar: amate ukna nuai ah om mite taw a kingawm lampui 200, (hi lampuite in Israel te ii a vawt tu sia le a vawt tu a phabel hun a he uh hi); Zebulun: ngalsim tu a kinging, ngalhiam theampo a zangh thei, a thumaan le a muanhuai pasal 50,000; Naphtali: lampuite 1,000 le lum le tei toai pasal 37,000; Dan: ngalsim a sinsa pasal 28,600; Asher: ngalsim tu a kithoaisa pasal 40,000; Jordan ngun ii nisuana sangah a om minamte — Reuben, Gad le nisuana sang Manasseh te: ngalhiam a nanam a zakna a kisin saksa pasal 120,000 te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ngal sim tu in a kithoai hi ngalkapte theampo in Israel ngam theampo atu David sia kumpi suaksak tu in khensat a, Hebron ah pai uh hi. A taanglai Israel mi theampo in tuabang ma tupna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ngammipuite ii a vaihawmsak sa an le tuite David taw ni thum sung tualai ah nekhawm dawn khawmin om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Saksang namte ahi Issachar, Zebulun, le Naphtali pan mite dong ngawngawn in laa, kalaoh, siphu le khuitalte taw neak thei — anvui, thei, sapitngawm, sapittui le olive thaute a khopteak hong paipui uh hi. Amate in ngaw tu le neak tu in khui le tuu zongh paipui uh hi. Hi teng theampo sia a ngam bup ii lungdamna a lakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David kumpipa sia mi tulkhat ukte le zakhat uk ngalkapmangte theampo taw thu kikum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Israel mite theampo tungah ama in, “Note lungkim in, Topa ih Pathian ii deina a om le ih ngammi om lai te, thiampite le a khua ah a om Levi te kungah kamtaite paisak in, eima taw hi sungah hong kikhawm tek tu in vaitha tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang eite pai in, Saul ii kumpi a sep lai a, a ki awlmawk ngawl Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia ih la tu hi,” ci in taangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipite sia tua ngaisutna thukim in lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hi a, David in Israel ngamsung theampo, thangsang Egypt ngamngi pan saksang Hamath Mualciangh dong ah a teang Israel mite Kiriath Jearim pan Jerusalem khuapi ah Thuciamna Thingkuang paipui tu in kikhawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David le mipite sia Judah ngam Kiriath Jearim ahi Baalah khuapi ah Cherubim tungah a tosak Topa min a pua Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang la tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in Abinadab inn pan Thuciamna Thingkuang pusua in khuileang thak khat tungah suan uh hi. Uzzah le Ahio in khuileang hawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David le Israel mite theampo Pathian patoai in a tha neiza taw laam uh hi. Amate lasa in, tengtongh, khuang, daalkopsai le lemle te tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate Chidon kici ancilna mun a thet laitakin khuitalte liik a, tuaciang Uzzah in a khut zanin Thuciamna Thingkuang zamh a len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thakhatin Uzzah tungah Topa thin uuk a, tua thingkuang a tham hu in thatlum paih hi. Ama tua mun Pathian mai ah thi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuasia hu in, tua mun sia tua hun pan kipan Perez Uzzah kici hi. Uzzah tungah Topa thin uuk in daan a piak hu in David a thinso hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia ciang David in Pathian kiita in, “Hi Thuciamna Thingkuang tu in koi bangin paipui thei tu khi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom David in Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Jerusalem ah tonpui ngawl hi. Gath khuapi mi Obed Edom kici pa inn ah nusia zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua munah Thuciamna Thingkuang tha thum sung om a, Topa in Obed Edom innkuan le a neisa theampo thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tyre kumpipa Hiram in David kungah sumlei sumzuak vai thu son tu palai paisak a; kumpi inn a sak natu in Cedar thingluangte, a sa tu in suangciangte le lettamate taw puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in ama Israel kumpi in kipsak zo a, ama mite atu in a kumpi ngam khangtosak ahi hunlam David in phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem ah David in zi tam ma nei thua in, tanu tapa tam ma toai thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem pan a nei tate, a nuai a bang hi a: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nogah, Nepheg, Japhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elishama, Beeliada, le Eliphelet te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in David sia Israel ngam bup kumpipa kisuaksak zo ci in Philistine te in a zaak uh ciang a man tu in a ngalkaphonpi paisak hi. Tua ahiciang David in amate sim tu in kuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Philistine te Rephaim Kuam theng a, vanh suttol tu kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in Pathian tungah, “Philistine te ka sim tu ziam? Ngalzawna nong pia tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Topa in, “Hi hi, sim in! Zawna kong pia tu hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang David in amate Baal Perazim ah simin zo hi. Ama in, “Tuikhang bangin ngalte ngalkaphonpi a phul let tu in Pathian in keima hong zangh hi,” ci hi. Tua hu in tua mun sia Baal Perazim kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Philistine te a taikeak ciang a milimte nusia a, David in tua milimte hal tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hai ngawlin Philistine te tua kuam ah heak kikin vanh suttol tu in kipan kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khatvei ma David in dongh kik a, Pathian in, “Hi sung pan sim heak in a, kiimveal in, a langkhat sang balsam thingkungte nai pan sim tu in kithoai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thingkung dawnte tungah kalsuan nging na zaak uh ciang, sim vun, banghang ziam cile Philistine ngalkaphonpi zaw natu in na mai ah ka pai tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in Pathian thupiak bangin seam ahikom Philistine te Gibeon pan Gezer dongin not kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David ii minthanna mun theampo ah kizel a, Topa in minam theampo in ama kiitasak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in ama aituam zak tu in David khuapi sungah innte sa hi. Ama in Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang atu in mun khat vawtin puanbuk khat zongh saksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang David in, “Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Levi te bek in pua thei tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate sia Pathian in Thuciamna Thingkuang pua tu le a tawntung ama ii na a seam tu in a tealsa te ahi uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A vawt kholsa munah Thuciamna Thingkuang paipui tu in David in Israel mite theampo Jerusalem ah sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Levi te le Aaron suan le paalte sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Levi te Kohath bee le phung sung pan ama ii mihing 120 a uk Uriel hong pai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Merari bee le phung sung pan mihing 220 a uk Asaiah hong pai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershon bee le phung sung pan mihing 130 a uk Joel hong pai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elizaphan bee le phung sung pan mihing 200 a uk Shemaiah hong pai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hebron bee le phung sung pan mihing 80 a uk Eliel hong pai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uzziel bee le phung sung pan mihing 112 a uk Amminadab hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in thiampi Zadok le Abiathar le Levi mi luk ahi Uriel, Asaiah, Joel, Shemaiah, Eliel le Amminadab te sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Levi te tungah, “Note sia Levi bee le phung lampuite na hi uh hi. Ka vawt kholsa munah Israel Topa Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang na paipui thei natu uh in noma le noma kithiansua vun a, na Levi mipuite zongh thiansua vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A masa lai in tua munah Thuciamna Thingkuang pua tu in nong om bua uh a, ama ih biak tu bangin ih biak ngawl hu in, Topa ih Pathian in eite daan hong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel te Topa Pathian ii Thuciamna Thingkuang khiin tu in thiampite le Levi te amate le amate kithiansua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses tungtawnin Topa thupiak bangin Levi te in Thuciamna Thingkuang sia a liangko tungah molte taw zawngin pua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in Levi te lampuite tungah lungdamna lasa tu, tengtongh tum tu, daalkopsai tum tu, Levi mi tuatuamte a see tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in lasa te ii bee le phungte sung pan taau daalkopsai tum tu in a nuai a mite teal a: Joel ii tapa Heman, a beepa Berechiah ii tapa Asaph, le Merari bee le phung pan Kushaiah ii tapa Ethan te ahi hi. Amate in tuate a hu tu in a nuai a Levi te, tengtongh aw eute tum tu in teal a: Zechariah, Jaaziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Maaseiah, le Benaiah te ahi hi. Tengtongh aw unte tum tu in amate in a nuai a Levi te teal a: Mattithiah, Eliphelehu, Mikneiah, Azaziah, le biakinn cingte Obed Edom, le Jeiel te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Music a thiam hu in Chenaniah sia Levi music thiamte uk tu in kiteal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Berechiah le Elkanah sia Obed Edom le Jehiah taw Thuciamna Thingkuang cing tu in kiteal hi. Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah lemle tum tu in thiampi ahi Shebaniah, Joshaphat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zechariah, Benaiah le Eliezer te kiteal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabangin David kumpipa, Israel lampuite le ngalkapmangte Thuciamna Thingkuang la tu in Obed Edom inn ah pai in thupi takin poai vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in Thuciamna Thingkuang a pua Levi te in Pathian huna a nga nanak natu in khuital sali le tuu salite sangaw biakpiakna in pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David le music thiamte, a lampui Chenaniah le Thuciamna Thingkuang a pua Levi te zong in puanneal phabel taw a kivawt puantualte veu silh uh hi. David zongh puanneal ephod khat silh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel te theampo in Thuciamna Thingkuang sia lungdamna taw au in lemle, sakii, daalkopsai le tengtonghte tum kawmin Jerusalem khua ah tonpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang sia khuapi sungah a tumpui laitak Saul ii tanu Michal in khelki pan en a, David kumpipa lungdamna taw laamin a lelen a mu ciangin mu thada huai sa hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate in Thuciamna Thingkuang a koi natu in David ii a saksa puanbuk sungah tua in koi uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate in Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiaknate le kipawlkhop biakpiaknate pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in sangaw biakpiaknate a man zawkciang Topa min taw mipite thupha pia in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an zongh a vekpi in hawmsak hi. Ama in Israel mite theampo pasal, numei khat sim anluum khat tek, sa em bek khat tek le sapitngawm tawm tek pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah lasakna le ama pokna taw Topa Israel te ii Pathian biakna ah lampui tu in Levi mite pawlkhat panmun pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asaph sia lampui in koi a, a hupa tu in Zechariah koi hi. Jeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Mattithiah, Eliab, Benaiah, Obed Edom le Jeiel te sia tengtongh tum tu in koi hi. Asaph sia daalkopsai tum tu pa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thiampi nii ahi Benaiah le Jahaziel sia Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah a huhun in lemle a tum tu te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hunin David in Asaph le a Levi mipuite Topa tungah pokna late sa tu in nasep pia masa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko vun, ama ii letna thangsak vun; ama ii sepsate minamte tungah son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa tungah pokna lasa vun; a lamdang a nasep sate son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama aa ih hi sia lungdam vun; ama a biate theampo lungdam thinnuam tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huna ngen tu in Topa zuan vun; tatsat ngawlin ama bia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No Pathian ii naseampa Jacob ii suan le paalte, Pathian ii teal Israel ii suan le paalte awng, Pathian ii nalamdang laknate le a thukhennate phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa sia ih Pathian hi; a thupiakte sia leitung bup atu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tawntung a kip tu a vawt Pathian ii thuciamna
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham taw a vawt thuciamna, Isaac tungah a kamciamna mangil ngei heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Jacob taw thuciamna khat vawt a, a tawntung a kip tu khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Canaan ngam nang kong pia tu a, nangma aituam neisa tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian ii mite tawm a, Canaan ngam ah khualmi suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate ngam khat pan ngam khat, kumpi ngam khat pan kumpi ngam khat ah vak kawkoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong Pathian in amate kuama in nengcipsak ngawl hi; amate a dal tu in Pathian in kumpite hi bangin thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka tealsa ka naseamte bangma law heak vun; ka kamsaangte thutha heak vun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leitung bup awng, Topa tungah lasa vun! ama ii eite hong ngupna lungdamna thuphate ni simin thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minamte tungah a minthanna thangsak vun, mite theampo tungah a nasep liante thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa sia lian a, nasia tak pok tu ahi hi; ama sia pathiante theampo sangin patoai zawk tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A dang minam theampote ii pathiante sia milim bekma hi a, ahihang Topa in vantungte bitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Minthanna le vaangneina in ama kiim uumin, a Biakinnpi vaangletna le lungdamna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Leitung mi theampo awng Topa pok vun, a minthanna le a thahatna pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa ii minthanna pok vun; biakpiakna khat kengin a Biakinnpi sungah pai vun. Tua Thiangtho Pa a kilangh ciangin a mai ah kun vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />leitung mi theampo awng a mai ah liingin om vun! Leitung sia a kip a kho in kikoi a, kikhiin thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Van le lei awng lungdam vun! Topa sia kumpipa hi ci in minamte son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuipi awng, na sungah a om nganhingte theampo taw hawk vun; lote awng, na sungah a om theampo taw lungdam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leitung uk tu in Topa hong pai ciang, thingtaam sung a om thingkungte lungdam in au tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi; ama ii itna in mong nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama tungah, “Kote ii Ngumpa Pathian awng, ko hong ngum ta'n; kote hong khawmtua ta'n; lungdam takin na min thiangtho kong pok thei natu in minamte khut sung pan hong suatak ta'n,” ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian Topa pok vun! Tu le a tawntungin ama pok vun! Tuasia ciang mi theampo in, “Amen,” ci in Topa pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />David kumpipa in Asaph le a Levi mipuite Thuciamna Thingkuang a kikepna munah a kivawt biakpiakna sungah a uk tawntung tu in koi hi. Amate in ni khat zawk ni khat amate nasep tek tua munah seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate sia Jeduthun ii tapa Obed Edom le ama bee le phung pan pasal 68 te in hu tu hi. Hosah le Obed Edom te sia kongcing ukte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahizong thiampi Zadok le a thiampi seppuite sia Gibeon ah a om Topa biakpiakna munah a ukte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Topa in Israel te tungah a piak thukham sungah a ki at bangin amate in zing sim, nitak sim sangaw biakpiaknate biaknatau tungah a pum bup halin pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A mong nei ngawl Topa hong itna pokna la Topa tungah sa tu in Heman le Jeduthun te le a kitealtuam dangte zongh amate taw tua munah omkhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Pokna late a sak uh ciang a tum uh lemle, daalkopsai te le a dang tumthei vanhte Heman le Jeduthun zongh in uksak hi. Jeduthun ii bee le phungte sia kongcing ukte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a kuama po a inn ah cia tek in, David zongh a innkuanpuite taw hun khat zangh khawm tu in cia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in David kumpipa sia a kumpi inn ah teang hi. Ni khat ni in David in kamsaangpa Nathan samin ama tungah, “Kei hi sung cedar thing taw a kisa inn sungah teang khi hi, ahihang Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia puanbuk sungah kikeam hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nathan in, “Na thinsung a om babangin seam in, banghang ziam cile Pathian nang taw omkhawm hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong tua zanin Pathian in Nathan tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka naseampa David kungah va pai ta'n a, ka ci teng son in, ‘Ka teen natu biakinn khat a sa tu sia nang na hi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mite Egypt ngam pan ka suatak ni pan kipan tu dong biakinn khat sungah ka teang ngei bua hi; puanbukte sungah teang tawntung in, mun khat pan mun khat ah ka kikhiin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite taw ka khualhawna theampo ah a lampui in ka koite khat pawpo ii tungah banghangin kei atu cedar thing taw biakinn hong saksak ngawl nu ziam ci in ka dongh ngei bua hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tua ahiciangin ka naseampa David tungah keima Vaanglianbelpa Topa in hi bangin ka ci sia va son ta'n, ‘Lo sung na tuu cinna panin nangma kong la a, ka Israel mite ukpa kong suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na paina theampo ah kong ompui a, na mai ah na ngal theampo kong zawsak hi. Leitung ah lampui lianbelte bangin na min kong thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel ka mite atu in mun khat ka tealsak a, tua munah ka teangsak zo hi, amate tua munah kuama in nengcip nawn ngawl tu hi. Amate hi ngam a thet ni pan kipan a ngoltol mite in sim bul uh hi, ahizong tuabang piang kik nawn ngawl tu hi. Na ngalte theampo na zaw natu uh le suan le paalte na nei natu uh in kong kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thi ciang le na taanghpupite taw hong kiphum khop ciangin na tapate sung pan khat, kumpi ka suaksak tu a, a kumpi ngam thahat paisuaksak tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama sia keima atu in biakinn a sa pa hi tu a, a kumpi khangngui ka kizom suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in a pa ka hi tu a, ama sia ka ta hi tu hi. Nangma kumpi na sua thei natu in Saul ka hepkeak bangin ama ka khuangkhosakna ka dok kik buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite le ka kumpi ngam a tawntungin ka uksak tu hi. Ama kumpi khangngui sia a bo ngei buatu hi,’ ” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian ii ama tung a, a pualaak thu theampo Nathan in David tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang David kumpipa sia Topa ompuina Puanbuk sungah pai a, to in thungen hi, “ Topa Pathian awng, kei tung ahizong ka innkuanpuite tung ahizong nong septe ka kiphu ka kilawm bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua hi napi tu in a tamzaw lai in nong seam hi; mai sangah ka suan ka paalte atu dong kamciamte nong pia zo hi, Topa Pathian awng, nangma in kei mi lian khat bangin nong thupi vawt zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangdang hong ci thei lai tu khi ziam! Na naseampa kei nong he mama a, ahihang nong upat lalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi bangin nong hina sia kei atu in na deina le na tupna om a, mai sangah ka let natu nong lakna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa awng nang taw a kibang kuama om ngawl hi; nangma bek Pathian na hi hunlam kong he tawntung zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma aituam mite hong suak tu in sila pan na suatak Israel mite taw a kibang leitung ah minam dang om ngawl hi. Amate tungah a lamdang na liante na vawtna taw leitung bup ah na minthanna kizel hi. Egypt panin na mite suatak a, amate mailam a nawk ciang minam dangte na notkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mite a tawntungin nangma mi tu in na vawt zo a, nangma Topa in amate ii Pathian na suak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuaciang tu in, Topa awng, kei le ka suan ka paalte nong piak kamciamna sia a tawntung atu in hong taangtungsak ta'n a, ka seam tu na ci te seam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na minthanna sia lian tu a, mite in a tawntungin, ‘ Topa Vaanglianbelpa sia Israel ii Pathian hi,’ ci tu uh hi. Tuaciang nangma in ka kumpi khangngui sia hun theampo ah nong kepsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang tungah hi thungetna hang takin kong ngen ngam hi, banghang ziam cile, nangma in kei na naseampa tungah hi teng nong pualaak zo a, ka suan ka paalte kumpi na suasak tu nong son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa awng, nang Pathian na hi a, hi a lamdang kamciamna nong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na maipha a nga tawntung tu in ka suan le ka paalte thupha nong piaksak natu in kong ngen hi. Topa awng, nangma in amate thupha na pia zo a, na piak thupha a tawntungin kip tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun tawmvei zawkciang David kumpipa in Philistine te sim kikin zo hi. Ama in amate ii a uk Gath khuapi le a kiim ah khuanote la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab te zongh zo a, a khutnuai suak in David tungah shia pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in Syria ngamsung Zobah ngam ukpa Hadadezer kumpipa sia Hamath ngam nai na ah sim hi. Banghang ziam cile ama in Eupharates ngunnaak sangah a om ngam sia uk tu hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in a siphu ngalleang tulkhat, siphu ngalkap 7,000 le lei ngalkap 20,000 man hi. Ama in leang zakhat kai tu siphu kisam za khe in a dangte theampo a peangbaisak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damascus ah a om Syria te in Hadadezer kumpipa hu tu in a ngalkaphonpi a paisak ciang, David in simin, 22,000 thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in amate ii ngam sungah ngalkap ngiaphualte saat a, amate a khutnuai suaksakin phiangshia piasak hi. Topa in David sia mun theampo ah zawna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hadadezer ii uliante puak khamh ngaldalna lumte David in matsakin Jerusalem ah ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Hadadezer ukna Tibhath le Kun khuapite panin taau tam mama zongh la hi. (Solomon in a khaksang ciang, tuate taw Biakinnpi atu kuang le beal te, khuam te le tuikuang vawt hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Hadadezer ii ngalkaphonpi bup zo siat ci thu Hamath kumpipa Toi in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahiciang David kumpipa muak tu le Toi ii tamvei mama a sim bul Hadadezer a zawna lungdamko tu in ama in a tapa Joram paisak hi. Joram in khamh, ngunn, le taau taw a kivawt letsongte David puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua te sia David kumpipa in a zawthal ngamte — Edom, Moab, Ammon, Philistia le Amalek pan a laak ngunn le khamhte taw biakna ah zak tu in aap khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nu Zeruiah ahi Abishai in Ci Kuam ah Edom te zo in 18,000 that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Edom ngamsung theampo ah ngalkap ngiaphualte saat in tua munah a teang mite David kumpipa khutnuai suak hi. Topa in David sia mun theampo ah ngalzosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in Israel ngam bup ukin, a mite a tawntungin a kilawm bang le thumaan thutang taw a kithupi vawt natu in vaihawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abishai ii suapui pa Joab sia ngalkaphonpi ukpa; Ahilud ii tapa Jehoshaphat sia thu theampo tepteena ukpa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahitub ii tapa Zadok le Abiathar ii tapa Ahimelech te in thiampi; Seraiah in zum thuzeakpi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada ii tapa Benaiah sia David a cingte ukpa; tuaciang David kumpipa tapate in a kumpi sepna sungah a za lian te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang Ammon kumpipa Nahash thi in, a tapa Hanun kumpi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David kumpipa in, “A pa Nahash in kei tungah thumaan kilawmtatna hong nei bangin Hanun tungah ka vawt kik tu hi,” ci hi. Tua hi a David in a khuangaipuina thu lak tu in kamtaite paisak hi. Amate Ammon ngam thengin Hanun kumpipa kungah a pai uh ciang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon lampuite in kumpipa tungah, “Nang khuangai puina hong lak tu in, David in hi kamtaite hong paisak sia na pa a zatak hang hi tu in na um ziam? Hi ngawl het hi! Ama in hong zawthal thei natu in ngamsung en kawkoai tu in ngalvilte hi sungah hong paisak hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David ii kamtaite Hanun in manin, a khamul meetsakin a puante a ngoaibul ciang a tansak zawkciang tha kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate inn a zot tu a maizum mama uh hi. Tua thu David in a zaak ciang, amate a khamul sau kik dong cia ngawlin Jericho ah a taam natu in kam vaitha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in David sia a ngal a suasak hunlam Hanun kumpipa le Ammon te in a tel uh ciang Mesopotamia tungnung le Syria ngam Maacah le Zobah te pan siphu ngalleangte le siphu ngalleang ukte cial natu in ngunn kilogramme 34,000 pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A cial siphu ngalleang 32,000 te le Maacah kumpipa ngalkaphonpi pai in Medeba khua hui ah ngiaphual saat uh hi. Ammon mite zongh a khuapi theampo pan pai tekin ngalsim tu in kinging uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua thu David in a zaak ciang Joab le a ngalkaphonpi bup paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ammon mite hong kuanin amate khuapi ahi Rabbah khua suazoai ah panmun la in amate hu tu in hong pai kumpite in ngam taanzauna ah panmun la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joab in a ngalte in maisang le nungsang panin hong sim nuam hi ci a mu ciang Israel ngalkap phabel teng tealin Syria te maingat in panmun lasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a ngalkap om lai teng a suapuipa Abishai lampuisak a Ammon te maingat in panmun lasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joab in ama tungah, “Syria te in kei hong zaw nong mu le hong pai in hong hu ta'n a, Ammon te in nang hong zo le pai in kong hu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thahat in a, hang in! Ih mipuite atu le ih Pathian ii khuapite atu in nasia takin ngal ih do tu hi. Topa deina bang hi tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joab le a mite in sim tu in a manaw uh ciang Syria te taimang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ammon te in Syria te a taimang a mu uh ciang amate zongh Abishai kung pan tai in khuapi sungah nungkin uh hi. Tua zawkciang Joab Jerusalem ah cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel te ii zaw hunlam Syria te in a heak uh ciang Euphrates ngun nisuana sang Syria ngamte pan ngalkapte keng in, Zobah ngam uk Hadadezer kumpipa ii ngalkaphonpi a uk Shobach khutnuai ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua thu David in a zaak ciang Israel ngalkapte khawmtua a, Jordan ngun kaanin Syria ngalkapte maingat in panmun la uh hi. A kisim uh ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel te in Syria ngalkaphonpi not kik uh hi. David le a mite in Syria siphu ngalleang hawlte 7,000 le lei ngalkap 40,000 that uh hi. Amate in Syria ngalkapmang Shobach zongh that uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadadezer kumpipa khutnuai a om kumpite in Israel ii amate a zaw hunlam a heak uh ciang David taw kilemna vawt in, David khutnuai mi suak uh hi. Syria te in Ammon mite hu kik nuam ngeingawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpite ii ngalsim hun veu ahi khuakhaal hun a thet kik ciang Joab in ngalkaphonpi lampui in Ammon ngam sim uh hi; ahizong David kumpipa sia Jerusalem ah om hi. Amate in Rabbah khuapi uumci in sim a, lalcipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ammon te biak milim Molech in kilogramme 34 bang a ngit khamh kumpilukhu khat nei hi. Tua ii sungah suangmanpha khat om a, tuasia David in la in ama kumpilukhu tungah suang hi. Ama in khuapi sung pan vanh a laakte honpi khat zongh ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in khuapi sung mite paipui in thingatnam, thik tumanh, le heite taw na seamsak hi. Ammon ngam khua dangte theampo ah a om mite zong tuabang ma in seamsak hi. Tua zawkciang ama le a mite Jerusalem ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang Philistine te taw Gezer ah ngal kidona om kik hi. Tua tungin Hushah pan Sibbecai in a thatang lian Sippai a kici pa thatin, Philistine te zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Philistine te taw ngal kisimna dangkhat om kik in, Jair ii tapa Elhanan in Gath pan Goliath suapuipa Lahmi that hi. Lahmi ii a tei sia thiamtana pumlawng cia saa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gath ah khatvei ma ngal kisimna khat om in, tua khua sungah a khut te nii ah khutme luk veve, a peang te nii ah peangme luk veve a nei thatang lian khat om hi. Ama sia nidang lai in mihing thatang liante suan khat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua pa in Israel te nalh ahikom David ii suapuipa Shammah ii tapa Jonathan in thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David le a mite ii a thalup hi mihing thumte sia Gath khua ah a om thatang liante ii suan le paalte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Satan in Israel mite tungah ngimna thengsak nuam ahikom ama in David sia mi simna vawt tu in khensatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Joab le a ngalkapmang dangte tungah, “Israel ngam mong khat pan mong khat dong pai in mi phaza sim vun. Mihing bangza pha ziam he nuam khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joab in, “ Topa in Israel mite tu a zaa sangin a see zakhat in pungsak zaw tahen! Kumpipa awng, amate theampo nangma naseamte hi. Banghangin na minam bup mawpu tu in hi mi simna vawt nuam ni ziam?,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa in Joab sia tua thupiakna nisak hi. Joab pai in Israel ngamsung buppi khualhaw a, tua zawkciang Jerusalem ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in David kumpipa tungah ngalkap seam thei pasal avekpi: Israel ah 1,100,000 le Judah ah 470,000 om hi ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joab in kumpipa ii thupiak lungkim ngawl ahiciang Levi le Benjamin namte ii mi simna vawt ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi bang a kisepna sia Pathian lungkim ngawl ahiciang Israel te daan pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Pathian tungah, “Hi bangin ka ngamtatna taw mawna a lauhuai mama khat vawt zo khi hi! Nong hesuakna in hong maisak ta'n. A mawmawthuai in ngamta zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in David ii kamsaangpa Gad tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Va pai ta'n a, a teal tu in thu nam thum ka piak sia David tungah son ta'n. A teal bang pawpo vawt tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gad sia David kungah pai in Topa ii ci teng son a, “Koi sia na teal tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum thum sung kial tung tu maw? Ahibuale tha thum sung na ngalte ii ngalkaphonpite mai pan tai tu maw? Ahibuale Topa in a namsau taw nang ni thum sung hong simin a vantunglalang zanghin Israel ngamsung theampo ah a kilaw thei natna hong puak a, thina hong tungsak tu maw? Topa tungah na zo na koisia son tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in Gad tungah, “Ka ci ka law he ngawl khi hi! Ahihang mihingte ii daan hong piak tu ka nuam bua hi. Kei daan hong pia tu sia Topa ama ma hi tahen, banghang ziam cile ama hesuakna thin nei hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in Israel mite tungah a kilaw thei natna tungsakin amate sung pan 70,000 thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem susia tu in vantunglalang khat paisak a, ahihang a thin kheal kikin vantunglalang tungah, “Tawlnga in! Tu a za pha zo hi!” ci hi. Vantunglalang sia Jebus mi Araunah ii ancilna hui ah ding nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem susia tu in a kithoai, a khut sungah namsau a toai vantunglalang sia vui sungah a ding David in mu hi. Tuaciang David le Israel lampuite — a vekpi khau-ip puan silh siatin — a mai lei pha dongin kunsuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in, “Pathian awng, a khial sia keima khi hi. Misim natu thu a pia sia keima khi hi. Hi mizawngte in bang vawt nei na ziam? Topa ka Pathian awng, keima le ka innkuanpuite daan hong pia ta'n a, na mite khoaikhe in,” ci in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa vantunglalang in Gad tungah, Topa atu in Araunah ii ancilna munah, David paisak in biaknatau khat a sak natu thupia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gad ii son bangma Topa thupiak mang in David pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ancilna munah Araunah le a tapa li teng zungtaang cil in a om laitak hi a, vantunglalang a mu ciang a tapate tai in buu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Araunah in David kumpipa ama sang zuanin hong pai a mu poma ciang a ancilna mun nusia in a mai lei a phak dongin kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in ama tungah, “Natna kilaw thei sia a theau natu Topa atu biaknatau khat ka sak thei natu na ancilna mun hong zuak ta'n. Tua ahibuale a kilaw thei pulnatna thai ngawl tu hi. A man sia a cing in nangma hong pia tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Araunah in, “Kumpipa awng, tuasia la in a, na dei bang po in zangh in. Biaknatau tungah biakpiakna in a hal tu khuitalte hi sungah om hi; thingthu tu in ancilna ah a kidaw suatte om a, biakpiak natu in zungtaangte om hi. A vekpi in nang kong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahizong kumpipa in, “Hi ngawl hi, a man a cingin hong pia tu khi hi. Topa biakpiakna in nangma neisa khat pawpo zangh ngawl tu khi hi, a man ka piak ngawl khat peuma hi ngawl tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in ancilna mun atu in khamh dangkatang 600 Araunah tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in tua munah Topa atu in biaknatau khat sa in meihal biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiakna pia hi. Ama in thungen a, Topa in a thungetna saang ahikom biaknatau tungah biakpiaknate a kaanghsak tu in vantung pan meikuang khiaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in a vantunglalang tungah a namsau sot kikin sawl ahikom vantunglalang in a thu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua thu David in a mu ciang Topa in ka thungetna hong saang hi ci in tel ahikom ama in Araunah ii ancilna mun biaknatau tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses ii duisung ngampa sungah a sak Topa ompuina Puanbuk le sangaw biakpiaknate a halna biaknatau te sia tua a biakna mun Gibeon ah tu hun zong om lai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ahihang David sia Topa bia tu in tua munah pai thei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Topa vantunglalang ii namsau kiita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahiciang David in, “Hi mun sia Topa Pathian Biakinnpi om natu mun hi. Hi lai ah Israel mite ii meihal biakpiaknate a piak natu biaknatau om hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David kumpipa in Israel ngam sungah a teang ngamdangmite theampo a kikhoptua natu thupia in na seamsak hi. Amate pawlkhat in Biakinnpi sak natu in suang king neite vawtkhol uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in thikpim le thing kongkhapi te letnate vawt natu in a piak thik tam mama zo a, tuaciang taau a piak zongh tam leih ahikom kuama in toaitee zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Tyre le Sidon mite sia ama atu in Cedar thingluang tam mama puaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in, “Ka tapa Solomon ii a sak tu Biakinnpi sia nasia mama tu a, leitung ah a minthang hi tu hi. Ahihang ama moi lai a, bangma seam ngeingawl lai ahikom keima in ka kingin kholsak kul tu hi,” ci in ngaisun hi. Tua ahikom David in a thi ma in vanh tam mama nga khol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in a tapa Solomon samin Topa, Israel te ii Pathian biakinn khat sa tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in ama tungah, “Ka tapa awng, Topa, ka Pathian patoai natu in biakinn khat sa nuam khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in ngal tam mama simin mihing tam mama that zo ni hi, hong ci hi. Tuabangin chi ka luansakte theampo hu in ama atu in biakinn hong sasak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahitazong ama in kamciam khat hong pia hi. Ama in, ‘Tapa khat na nei tu a tua na tapa in kilemna taw ngam uk tu hi, banghang ziam cile a ngalte theampo taw ngal kilemna ama ka pia tu hi. Ama min sia Solomon hi tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama kumpi maan hun sung tengin Israel ngam sungah kilemna le ngammuanna ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in keima atu in biakinn khat sa tu hi. Ama sia ka tapa hi tu a keima a pa ka hi tu hi. Ama kumpi khangngui zui in Israel ngam a tawntungin uk tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in a kampau zomin, “Tu in ka tapa awng, Topa na Pathian sia nang taw omkhawm tahen, ama atu in biakinn khat na sak zawk natu in ama in a kamciam taangtungsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel ngam sia ama Thukham bangin na uk thei natu in Topa na Pathian in a thuk mu tel theina le ciimna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa ii Israel te atu in Moses tungah a piak thukhamte theampo na zui le zawna nga tu ni hi. Citakin kimuang in a, bangma in patausak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biakinnpi taw kisai in ka hanciamna taw Biakinnpi sakna ah zak tu in khamh tann 34,000 vaal le ngunn tann 34,000 vaal ka khol zo hi. Tua dom ngawlin taau le thik a kiciangtan om ngawl za dongin om hi. Kei zongh in thing le suangte khol zo khi hi, ahizong na belap kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naseam mi tam mama nei ni hi. Suangkhuk ah naseamte, suangciangte, lettama te, tuaciang khut thiamna tuatuam a nei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />khamh, ngunn, taau le thik taw nasep a thiam zongh tam mama om hi. Tu in nasep kipan in a, Topa in hong ompui tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in Solomon hu tu in Israel lampui theampo thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa na Pathian sia nang taw omkhawm zo a, na kiim na paam theampo ah kilemna hong pia zo hi. Ama in keima sia ih ngam ah a teang ngei mite theampo hong zosak siat zo a, tu in amate sia nangma le Topa khutnuai ah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in na thinsung theampo le na thaa theampo taw Topa na Pathian na seam in. Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang le ama biakna ah a kizangh vanh thiangtho dangte theampo a sungah na koi thei natu in tua Biakinnpi sak kipan in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David a huai mama ciang ama in a tapa Solomon Israel kumpi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David kumpipa in Israel lampuite theampo le thiampite le Levi te theampo kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Levi mi pasal kum 30 le a tungsia theampo mi simna vawt hi. A vekpi in 38,000 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in 24,000 sia Biakinnpi nasep uk tu in koi a, 6,000 sia thu tepteena laibu keam tu le thukhen tu in koi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />4,000 in kongkha cingsak a, a dang 4,000 in kumpipa ii Topa pok natu a piak music vanhte zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Levi te sia amate bee le phung zui in pawl thum in khen a: Gershon, Kohath, le Merarite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershon in tapa nii nei a: Ladan le Shimei te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ladan in tapa thum nei a: Jehiel, Zetham le Joel te hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ladan ii suan bee le phung lampuite veu hi. (Shimei in tapa thum nei a: Shelomoth, Haziel, le Haran te hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Shimei in tapa li nei a: a piankum zui in Jahath, Zina, Jeush, le Beriah te hi. Jeush le Beriah in suan le paal tam nei ngawl ahikom amate sia bee le phung khat in kisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kohath in tapa li nei a: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tapa lianbel Amram sia Aaron le Moses ii pa hi. (Aaron le ama suan le paalte sia biakna vanh thiangthote a keam tawntung tu, Topa a biak uh ciang paaknamtui hal tu, ama naseam tu le ama min taw mite thupha pia tu in kikoituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong Pathian mihing Moses ii tapate sia Levi te sungah kihel hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in tapa nii nei a, Gershom le Eliezer te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gershon ii tapate sungah a lampuipa sia Shebuel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eliezer in tapa Rehabiah bek nei a, ahizong Rehabiah in suan le paal tam mama nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath ii tapa niina, Izhar in tapa khat Shelomith nei a, bee le phung lutang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kohath ii tapa thumna, Hebron in tapa li nei a: Jeriah, Amariah, Jahaziel, le Jekameam te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kohath ii tapa lina, Uzziel in tapa nii nei a, Micah le Isshiah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Merari in tapa nii nei a, Mahli le Mushi te hi. Mahli zongh in tapa nii nei a, Eleazar le Kish te hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ahizong Eleazar sia tanu bek nei a, tapa nei ngawlin thi hi. A tanute in a suapui sealhte ahi Kish ii tapate teenpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Merari ii tapa niina, Mushi in tapa thum nei a: Mahli, Eder, le Jeremoth te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hite sia Levi suan le paal hi a, a bee le phung le a innkuan zui in mi sim a min taw a kiciamtee te hi. Ama suan le paalte kum kul le a tungsia khat simin Topa Biakinnpi sungah nasep hawmna khat tek nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David in, “Israel ii Topa Pathian in a mite tungah kilemna pia zo a, ama mama a tawntungin Jerusalem ah teang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa ompuina Puanbuk le biakna ah a kizangh vanhte theampo Levi mite in puak kul nawn ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David ii a khakbel a thupiakna doppha in amate kum kul a cin ciang naseam tu in a min kiciamtee hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tuaciang amate a nuai a bangin vaipuak kisee hi: Aaron ii suan le paal thiampite ii biakinn ah biakna vawt a hu tu, suum sung teng le a inndoite keamcing tu, le biakna vanh thiangthote theampo ninsak ngawl tu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian tungah a kipia anluum, biakpiakna in a kizangh zungtaang vuite, tol kisaw ngawl muhpheangte, a ki em biakpiak nate, olive thau a kihel zungtaang vuite; biakinn ah a kipia vanhte toaikhai tu le teesak tu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />zing sim nitak simin Topa pok tu le a min thansak tu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tuaciang Topa tungah biakpiaknate Sabbath ni, Thadet Poai le poai dangte ah a kihal simin Topa pok tu le ama min thansak tu ahi hi. Hun simin hi nasep a seam tu Levi mi phaza a see na in a zui tu ngeina te kivawt hi. Hun theampo ah Topa biak natu vaipuak sia Levi te kiseesiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate sia Topa ompuina Puanbuk le Biakinnpi kepcing tu le biakinn biakpiakna sungah a mealheakte ahi Aaron suan thiampite hu tu in nasep kipia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aaron suan le paalte sia hi bangin a pawlin kikhen hi. Aaron in tapa li nei a: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nadab le Abihu sia a pa thi ma in thi a, suan le paal nei ngawl ahikom a suapuite Eleazar le Ithamar thiampi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David kumpipa in Aaron suan le paalte sia amate nasep taw kizui in a pawlin khen hi. Hi nasep khenna ah ama sia Eleazar ii suan Zadok le Ithamar ii suan Ahimelech in hu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazar ii suan le paalte sia pawl sawm le pawl luk in kikhen a, Ithamar ii suan le paalte sia pawl liat in kikhen hi; hi bangin a khen sia Eleazar ii suan le paalte sungah bangkua sim pan pasal tamzaw ahihang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eleazar le Ithamar ii suan le paalte sungah biakinn uliante le thaa lamsang lampuite om ahikom lai meetang sawk in nasep hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eleazar le Ithamar suan le paalte abaan abaan in lai meetang sawk hi. Tua zawkciang amate min sia Levi mi thuzeakpa, Nethanel tapa Shemaiah in lai taw ciamtee hi. Kumpipa, a uliante, thiampi Zadok, Abiathar tapa Ahimelech, thiampi innkuante le Levi mi innkuante ii lutangte sia tetti te vive hi siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi sia innkuan pawl 24 te nasep kipiakna hi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi mite sia Israel te Topa Pathian ii thupiak a zui na in a taanghpupi Aaron ii nasep tuatuam a omsak na bang in Biakinnpi ah pai tu le vaipuakte a sep natu a kisee na zui in a min uh kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hite sia Levi suan innkuan dangte ii lutangte hi a: Shebuel panin Amram ii suan Jehdeiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehabiah ii suan Isshiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shelomith panin Izhar ii suan Jahath;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hebron tapate sung pan a piankum zui in Jeriah, Amariah, Jehaziel, le Jekameam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Micah panin Uzziel ii suan Shamir;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Micah suapuipa Isshiah panin Uzziel suan Zechariah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Merari suan le paalte ahi Mahli, Mushi, le Jaaziah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaaziah in tapa thum nei a: Shoham, Zaccur le Ibri te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mahli in tapa nii Eleazar le Kish nei hi. Eleazar in tapa nei ngawl ahihang Kish in tapa khat, Jerahmeel nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mushi in tapa thum nei a: Mahli, Eder, le Jeremoth te ahi hi. Hiteng sia Levi te ii innkuante hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A mealheakte, Aaron suan thiampite ii a vawt bangma in naseam tu a see ciang innkuan sim pabel le a nau pate khat in lai meetang sawk hi. David kumpipa, Zadok, Ahimelech, tuaciang thiampi te le Levi te ii innkuan pabelte sia a tetti te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David kumpipa le Levi lampuite in a nuai a Levi bee le phungte sia biakna lampui tu in teal a: Asaph, Heman, le Jeduthun te ahi hi. Amate sia tengtongh le daalkopsai tumna taw thua in Pathian thu thangsak tute ahi hi. Hi sia in a pawl sim ii biakna vawtzia zui a, lampui tu in a kiteal mihingte min tepteena ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asaph tapa li teng: Zaccur, Joseph, Nethaniah, le Asharelah te ahi hi. Amate sia Asaph khutnuai hi a, ama sia kumpipa ii thupiak simin Pathian thu a thangsak pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeduthun ii tapa luk teng: Gedaliah, Zeri, Jeshaiah, Shimei, Hashabiah, le Mattithiah te ahi hi. A pa sawl bangin amate in tengtongh te tum kawmin Pathian thu thangsak a, Topa tungah pokna le lungdamkona lasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heman tapa sawm le li teng: Bukkiah, Mattaniah, Uzziel, Shebuel; Jerimoth, Hananiah, Hanani, Eliathah, Giddalti, Romamti Ezer, Joshbekashah, Mallothi, Hothir, le Mahazioth te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in a kamciamsa om bangin kumpipa ii kamsaangpa Heman tungah vaang a piakna in hi tapa sawm le li, le tanu thum te zongh pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Biakinn biak kikhopna ah a pa sawl bangin lampui in a tapate theampo in tengtongh le daalkopsai te tum uh hi. Asaph, Jeduthun, le Heman te sia kumpipa thupiak bangin ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi pasal 24 sia a vekpi in music vai a thiam mamate ahi hi; tuaciang a nasep pui Levi te sia music sinsa te veu hi. A vekpi in pasal 288 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nasep a kisee ciang khangmoi ahizong, khanghaam ahizong, a thiam sate ahibuale, a sin tuungte ahizong a vekpi in lai meetang sawk tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua pasal 288 te sia a innkuan zui in mihing sawm le nii tek a pha pawl 24 in kikhen a, pawl khat simin lampui khat in uk hi. A nuai a bangin a pawl a pawlin naseam a:
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hite sia biakinn a cing Levi te ii nasep kiseena ahi hi. Korah bee le phung panin Asaph innkuanpui Kore tapa Meshelemiah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tapa sali nei a, a piankum zui in: Zechariah, Jediael, Zebadiah, Jathniel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elam, Jehohanan, le Eliehoenai te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tapa liat piakna taw Pathian ii thupha a piak Obed Edom zongh om a, tua a tapate sia a piankum zui in: Shemaiah, Jehozabad, Joah, Sachar, Nethanel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ammiel, Issachar, le Peullethai te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Obed Edom ii tapa lianbel Shemaiah in tapa luk nei a: Othni, Rephael, Obed, Elzabad, Elihu, le Semachiah te ahi hi. Amate sia thiamna lian a nei uh hu in a bee le phung sungah mihing thupite ahi hi; a khakte nii sia thiam tuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi nasepna ah Obed Edom innkuan in a thiam mama sa mihing a vekpi in 62 pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meshelemiah ii innkuan in a thiamsa mihing sawm le liat pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Merari bee le phung pan Hosah om in, ama in tapa li nei a: Shimri (a tapa lianbel ahi ngawl hang a pa in lampui pia hi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hilkiah, Tebaliah, le Zechariah te ahi hi. Hosah innkuan sung pan biakinn cingte sia a vekpi in sawm le thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Levi dangte bangma in biakinn cingte sia innkuan zui in a pawlin kikhen a, Biakinnpi nasep kisee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kongpi koisia akua in cing tu cisia innkuan tam le tawm ci tuan ngawlin innkuan simin lai meetang sawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Shelemiah in nisuana sang kongpi, tuaciang ngual tungah ngaisutna pha a pia tawntung a tapa Zechariah in saksang kongpi nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Obed Edom sia thangsang kongpi, tuaciang a tapate sia vanh kholna inndoite kicingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shuppim le Hosah te sia nitumna sang kongpi le lam tungnung ah a om Shallecheth Kongpite kicingsak hi. Kong cin vaipuak sia a hun a hun in kisee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nisuana sangah ni simin kongcing luk, saksang ah li, tuaciang thangsang ah li kisee hi. Vanh kholna inndoite sia ni sim a cing li kikoi a, inndoi khat mihing nii veu in cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nitumna sang a om vanh kholna inndoi nai lampi hui ah a cing li om a, inncing tatak sia nii om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hisia Korah le Merari bee le phung te ii kongcing nasep kiseena ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A Levi mipui dangte in biakinn sum kholna le Pathian tungah a ki aap letsongte koina inndoite uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gershon tapate khat ahi Ladan sia innkuan pawl tam mama te ii taanghpupi hi a, a tapa Jehiel ii innkuan zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ladan tapa dangte nii ahi Zetham le Joel sia biakinn sum kholna le vanh kholna inndoite uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel ii suan le paalte tung zongh ah nasepte kisee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses tapa Gershom bee le phung pan Shebuel sia biakinn sum kholna a sai ulianbel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gershom ii suapui Eliezer taw kisai in ama sia Shelomith taw kimealhe hi. Eliezer sia Jeshiah ii pa ahi Rehabiah ii pa, Joram ii pa, Zichri ii pa, Shelomith ii pa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Shelomith le a innkuanpuite in Pathian tungah David kumpipa, bangkua pabelte, bee le phungte ii lampuite le ngalkap bute ii a aaptuam letsongte theampo keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in ngalsimna pan a laaksak vanhte pawlkhat la in Biakinnpi ah zak tu in aaptuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Shelomith le a innkuan sia Biakinnpi sung zak tu in a ki aaptuam hi vanhte theampo a saipa hi in, tua ii sungah kamsaang Samuel, Saul kumpipa, Ner tapa Abner, le Zeruiah tapa Joab te ii a puak letsongte zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izhar ih suan le paalte sung pan Chenaniah le a tapate sia ki ukna nasepte kisee a: thu tepteena laibute kepcingna le Israel mite thu kineinate ah thukhensak nasepte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hebron ii suan le paalte sung pan Hashabiah le a mealheak a kikhai tuam pasal 1,700 te sia Jordan ngun nitumna sang Israel ngam ah biakna paaina vai theampo le mipite ii vai theampo ki ukna ah a vaihawmte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jeriah sia Hebron suan le paalte lampuipa hi. David ii kumpi a sep zawk a kum 40 kum in Hebron ii suan le paal innkuan khangngui a kikat ciang hi innkuan sung pan ngalkap mindok pawlkhat Gilead ngam Jazer khua ah a teen sia kihe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David kumpipa in Jeriah mealheakte sung pan a mindok innkuan pabel 2,700 teal a, Jordan ngun nisuana sang Israel ngam — Reuben ngam, Gad ngam le Manasseh nisuana ngam sungah biakna paaina vai le mipite ii vai theampo uksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in, kumpi ngam atu nasepna a uk Israel innkuan lutangte le bee le phung lampuite, tuaciang kumpi ngamsung nasep a uk uliante min tepteena hi. Kumkhat sungah tha khat simin pawl tuatuam nasep kilaih a, pawlkhat ah pasal 24,000 in tua tha khat sung atu ngalkapmangpa ii khutnuai ah seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nuai a te sia tha khat sim atu ngalkapmangte veu hi a: Tha khatna ah: Zabdiel ii tapa Jashobeam (ama sia Judah nam, Perez bee le phung sung pan hi) Tha niina ah: Ahohi ii suan Dodai (ama a dom pa sia Mikloth hi) Tha thumna ah: Thiampi Jehoiada ii tapa Benaiah hi a; ama sia “Sawmthumte” ii lampuipa hi (a tapa Amizzabad in ama za laih hi) Tha lina ah: Joab ii suapuipa Asahel (a tapa Zebadiah in ama za laih in, hi pawl sia ii ngalkapmang hi) Tha ngana ah: Izhar ii suan Shamhuth Tha lukna ah: Tekoa pan Ikkesh ii tapa Ira Tha salina ah: Pelon pan Ephraim mi Helez Tha liatna ah: Hushah pan Sibbecai (ama sia Judah nam Zerah bee le phung sung pan hi) Tha kuana ah: Benjamin namte ii ngamsung Anathoth pan Abiezer Tha sawmna ah: Netophah pan Maharai (ama sia Zerah bee le phung sung pan hi) Tha sawm le tha khatna ah: Ephraim nam ii ngamsung Pirathon pan Benaiah Tha sawm le tha niina ah: Netophah pan Heldai (ama sia Othniel ii suan hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nuai a te sia Israel namte a ukte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa ii Israel mite van ah aksi za in ka pungsak tu hi ci in a kamciam om hu in David kumpipa in Israel mi kum kul nuaisia te sia mi simna vawt ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nu Zeruiah ahi Joab in mi simna vawt a, ahihang man ngawl hi. Hi mi simna hu in Pathian in Israel daan pia ahikom mihing pha za tatak sia David kumpipa ii zum laibu sungah kiciamtee ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nuai a te sia kumpi neisa vanh a ukte hi a: Kumpi neisa vanh koina inndoi te : Adiel ii tapa Azmaveth Mun tuatuam vanh kholna inndoite: Uzziah ii tapa Jonathan Lo nasepte: Chelub ii tapa Ezri Sapit huante: Ramah pan Shimei Sapittui kholnate: Shepham pan Zabdi Olive le sycomore kungte (nitumna sang mualpeangte ah): Geder pan Baal Hanan Olive thau kholna: Joash Sharon zaangtam ah khuite: Sharon pan Shirtai Ngamkuamte sungah khuite: Adlai ii tapa Shaphat Kalaoh te: Ishmael mi Obil Laate: Meronoth pan Jehdeiah Tuu le kealte: Hagri mi Jaziz
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David kumpipa ii pano Jonathan sia pilna saang nei khat hi a, ngaisutna a pia thiampa ahi hi. Ama le Hachmoni ii tapa Jehiel sia kumpipa tapate pilna sinna ah a ukte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahithophel sia kumpipa tungah ngaisutna a piapa hi a, Arch mi Hushai sia kumpipa ii lawm le thudokpa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahithophel thi zawkciang Abiathar le Benaiah ii tapa Jehoiada te sia ngaisutna a piate suak hi. Joab sia kumpi ngalkaphonpi ukpa hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David kumpipa in Israel ngamsung ulian theampo Jerusalem ah a kikhop natu in thupia hi. Tua ahikom a nam sim ii uliante, kumpi ngamsung nasep uk uliante, bee le phung lampuite, kumpipa le a tapate ii neisa vanhte le ngannote a cing a keamte theampo — a tatakin kumpi inn ah uliante, ngalkap lampuite le mihing thupi theampo — Jerusalem ah kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in amate mai ah ding a, amate tungah, “Ka ngammite awng hong ngai tavun. Topa ih Pathian peang ngakna Thuciamna Thingkuang koi natu in a om tawntung tu inn kip khat sa nuam khi hi. Pathian patoaina in biakinn khat sa tu ka kinging zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahizong keima in ngalkap khat hi a, chisan tam mama ka luansak hu in Topa in tua sia ka sep tu hong khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa Israel te ii Pathian in Israel a uk tawntung tu in keima le ka suan ka paalte hong teal hi. Ama in a lampui tu in Judah nam teal a, Judah nam sung pan ka pa teal hi. Tua innkuan bup sung pan ama uuk bangin kei hong laa a, Israel ngam theampo a uk kumpi hong suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in tapa tam hong pia a tuate theampo sung pan Topa ii kumpi ngam Israel uk tu in Solomon teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Topa in kei tungah, ‘Ka Biakinnpi a sa tu pa sia na tapa Solomon hi. Ama ka ta tu in ka teal zo a, keima a pa ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thukhamte le ka thupiakte theampo tu a, a zui bangin pha tak a zui zom le a kumpi ngam sia a tawntungin ka khomsuansak tu hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua ahikom tu in ka mite awng, hi ngampha sia na nei tawntung thei natu le khang khat zawk khang khat a kizomin na nei suak thei natu, Topa ih Pathian ii thupiakte theampo pha takin na zui natu in ih Pathian mai le Topa ii mi, Israel mite theampo kikhopna ah thu kong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciang Solomon tungah ama in, “Ka tapa awng, na pa ii Pathian sia thusim in a, lungkaa ngawlin uuk tatakna taw ama na seam in. Ama in ih thinsung tawngh le ih ngaisutna theampo he siat hi. Ama kung na zuan le ama in nang hong saang tu a; na taisan le a tawntungin nang hong nungngat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in ama Biakinnpi thiangtho a sa tu in nang hong teal zo ahi hunlam na tel kul hi. Tua nasep sia tu in seam in — citakna taw seam in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in Solomon tungah biakinn saknate, vanh kholna inndoite, inndoi dangte theampo ngealna le mawmaisakna Thiangthobel Mun atu ngealnate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama ngaisut sate theampo ahi leitualte le a kiimkot ah a om inndoite, biakinn vanh le Topa tungah a ki aaptuam letsongte kholna inndoite atu ngealnate zongh pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thiampite le Levi te kikaikhawm in a vawt tu nasepte ahi Biakinnpi ah a nasep tute le biakinn vanh ankuang anbealte theampo kepthiam natu ngealnate zongh David in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in kuang le bealte vawt natu in ngunn le khamh bangza zangh tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />meiinn le a detna khuam khat sim atu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ngunn sabuaite le Pathian a kipia anluumte koina khamh sabuai khat sim atu in ngunn le khamh bangza zak kul tu ci in ngealnate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in thikkeaukaate, kuangte le thawl ngong neite atu khamh ciitak bangza, pakante vawt natu in ngunn le khamh bangza kizangh tu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaciang ngimnamtui halna biaknatau le Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang tungah a thate phalin a om Cherubim tona leang vawt natu in khamh ciitak bangza kizangh tu cisia thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David kumpipa in, “Hiteng theampo sia Topa ama mama in ka sep ka vawt tu hong sawl na bang zui in a ki at sa ngealna sia sungah om hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David kumpipa in a tapa Solomon tungah, “Kimuang in na thin takkha in. Nasep kipan in a, bangma in khaktansak heak in. A na ka sep Topa Pathian sia nang taw hong omkhawm tu hi. Ama in nang hong nusia ngawl tu a, ama Biakinnpi nasep teng na man dong nang taw hong omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thiampite le Levi mite sia Biakinnpi sungah a nasep tute kiseesak zo hi. Thiamna namkim a nei naseamte sia nangma hong hu tu sia thalawp a, mite theampo le a lampuite sia nangma sawl babang seam tu in om uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David kumpipa in a kikhawmte theampo tungah, “Ka tapa Solomon sia Pathian tealsa hi, ahihang ama sia khangmoi lai a, a heakna kisam lai hi. A nasep tu sia thupi mama hi banghang ziam cile mihing atu kumpi inn a sa hi ngawl a, Topa Pathian atu biakinn sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hi zawkza in Biakinnpi sak natu vanhte — khamh, ngunn, taau, thik, thing, suangmanphate le gem suangte, a zepna suangnamte le marble tam ma ka kinging zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi ka kholsa vanhte bek dom ngawlin Pathian Biakinnpi atu ka deisak manin keima aituam neisa khamh le ngunn zongh ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biakinnpi pangte zep natu in khamh phabel tann zakhat vaal le ngunn ciitak tann zanii le sawmli dektak sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nasep thiamte ii vawt tu nate theampo atu zongh ka pia zo hi. Tu in akua dang in Topa tungah ngotakin pia nuam lai nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang bee le phung lutangte, minam uliante, ngalkaphonpi ukte le kumpi neisa vanh zeakte in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakinnpi sak natu in a nuai ah vanhte: khamh tann 170 vaal, ngunn tann 340 vaal, taau tann 620 dektak, le thik tann 3,400 vaal sia a uuk thu in pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suangmanpha neite in Gershon bee le phung pan Levi mi Jehiel ii a uk biakinn sum kholna ah pia tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipite in lawpna taw tazata a tam vanhte Topa tungah a piak sia lungdam uh hi. David kumpipa zongh a lungdam peuma hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David kumpipa in a kikhawm mihonpi bup mai ah Topa pok hi. Ama in, “Ka taanghpupi Jacob ii Topa Pathian awng, a tawntung a tawntungin nangma kipok tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma sia a lian, a vaanglian, a minthang, a lamdang le a tuanngen na hi hi. Leitung vantung ah a om theampo nangma aa hi a, nangma kumpi na hi a, tuate theampo a ukpipa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hauna le nei le lamh theampo nangma kung pan hong pai hi a; na vaangletna le na thahatna taw na theampo na uk hi; tuaciang kuama po a lian le a thahat na suaksak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in ka Pathian awng ka lungdamnate kong ko uh a na minthang kong pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ahitazong kei le ka mite in a tatakin bangma kong pia thei bua uh hi; banghang ziam cile na theampo nangma ii nong piakthong hi a, nangma aa tengma hong pia kik hi bek khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Oh Topa, nong heak hi a, ka nuntakna uh sia ka taanghpupite bangma in, saltaangte le khualmite bangin ka nungta uh hi. Ka ni ka hunte sia hong kaantan limh khat bang hi a, thina pan ka suakta thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Oh Topa, kote Pathian awng, na min thiangtho patoai natu biakinn khat sak natu in, hi nei le lamh theampo kong paipui tek uh hi; ahihang tuate theampo sia nangma kung pan hong paite veu hi a, a vekpi in nangma aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi theampo ii thinsung na ze et a, a citak mite tungah na lungkim hunlam ka he hi. Thumaanna le thinsung takpi taw keima uuk thu in hi teng theampo kong pia zo hi, tuaciang hi munah hong kikhawm na mite in nang kungah biakpiakna hong paipui tu sia bangza in lungdam ziam ci sia ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite uh ahi Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob ii Topa Pathian awng, tuabang hong kipiakna sia nangma mite thinsung ah a tawntungin khosak in a, nangma tungah a thumaante ahi natu in keamcing tawntung in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thupiak theampo a zui zawk natu le hi bangin Biakinnpi a sak natu ka kinginkhol nate taw a sak nop natu in ka tapa Solomon thin le lung sungah uuk takpina hong piaksak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David in mipite tungah: “ Topa na Pathian pok vun!” ci in thupia hi. A kikhawm mihonpi bup in Topa a taanghpupite ii Pathian pok in, a lu uh kun in Topa zatakna pia uh a, kumpipa zongh upatna pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A zing ciang amate in sangaw biakpiakna in ngannote ngo a Topa tungah aap hi, tua zawkciang, a neak tu in mipite pia uh hi. Tuaban ah amate in khuital tulkhat, tuutal tulkhat le, tuuno tulkhat te sia biaknatau tungah a pum bup in sangaw biakpiakna in hal uh hi. Amate in sapittui biakpiaknate zongh paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabangin tua ni in amate sia Topa mai ah anne tuidawn in lungdam ngualnuam mama in om uh hi. Amate in Solomon sia kumpi in a nii veina in thangsak uh hi. Amate in Solomon sia a ukpa tu in Topa min taw sathau noai a, Zadok sia thiampi seamsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabangin Topa ii kipsak kumpi tokhum tungah a pa David za laih in Solomon to hi. Ama in a cialcing kumpipa khat hi a, Israel minam bup in a thu ni uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Uliante le ngalkapte theampo, tuaciang David ii tapa dangte theampo ngawngawn in Solomon kumpipa tungah kong thumaan tu uh ci in kamciam pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon sia a ngam buppi in kiita in zakta a, Topa in Israel a uk kumpi dang a kuama po sangin a minthang zaw kumpi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesse tapa David in Israel ngam theampo sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />kum 40 sung uk hi. Ama in Hebron khua pan kum sali sung uk a, Jerusalem khua pan kum 33 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama hau in kizakta a, a khan haam mama zawkciang thi in, a tapa Solomon in a kumpiza laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David kumpipa ii taanghthu sia a kipat pan a tawpna dongin kamsaang thumte ahi, Samuel, Nathan, le Gad ii taanghthu khumnate sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua tepteenate in a ngam ukzia, vaang a neizia sia ama tung, Israel tung le a kiim a paam kumpi ngamte tungah a piang thute theampo hong lak hi.
  </para>
</usx>
